1
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:21,840
A little pause... and we are back.

2
00:00:51,980 --> 00:01:00,980
A little pause...
and we are back.

3
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:26,480
A little pause... and we are back.

4
00:01:35,269 --> 00:01:36,629
A little pause... and we are back.

5
00:01:38,234 --> 00:01:40,620
Why didn't somebody wake me up?

6
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,860
Where is everybody?

7
00:01:43,180 --> 00:01:44,180
Where'd they all go?

8
00:01:44,570 --> 00:01:45,570
Oh, Naruto.

9
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:48,220
Your sensei wanted to let you rest.

10
00:01:48,554 --> 00:01:49,600
You got the day off.

11
00:01:49,940 --> 00:01:51,160
I knew it!

12
00:01:51,161 --> 00:01:52,161
They ditched me!

13
00:01:55,780 --> 00:01:56,780
See ya!

14
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,480
Hold on!

15
00:02:01,699 --> 00:02:02,740
What the heck is this?

16
00:02:09,580 --> 00:02:10,699
What happened?

17
00:02:10,940 --> 00:02:12,000
Someone was here!

18
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,120
Someone got to them!

19
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,680
Could it be?

20
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:16,820
Inari!

21
00:02:17,060 --> 00:02:18,440
Could you give me a hand here?

22
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:19,900
Inari!

23
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:21,200
I'll be right there!

24
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:31,960
It's mist.

25
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:33,460
Sasuke!

26
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:33,880
Sakura!

27
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,080
Get ready!

28
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:42,180
I knew he was still alive.

29
00:02:42,460 --> 00:02:44,880
He just couldn't wait for round two.

30
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:48,060
Kakashi-sensei, it's Zabuza, isn't it?

31
00:02:48,140 --> 00:02:49,960
This is his hidden mist jutsu!

32
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:58,900
Sorry I kept you waiting, Kakashi.

33
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:01,960
I see you've still got those brats with
you.

34
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,820
That one's still trembling.

35
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:06,640
Pitiful.

36
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,840
I'm trembling with... excitement.

37
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:22,280
Go on, Sasuke.

38
00:03:33,140 --> 00:03:35,640
I can see it!

39
00:03:37,340 --> 00:03:37,840
Ooh!

40
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:40,480
Ooh, so you could see they were water
clones, huh?

41
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:42,320
The brat's improving.

42
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:46,060
Looks like you've got a rival,
Haku.

43
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,880
So it seems.

44
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:03,580
They could have woken me up!

45
00:04:15,390 --> 00:04:16,660
Well, well.

46
00:04:17,375 --> 00:04:18,660
So I had it right.

47
00:04:19,605 --> 00:04:21,019
It was all an act.

48
00:04:21,339 --> 00:04:22,460
An act?

49
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,360
With a cute little mask.

50
00:04:25,020 --> 00:04:25,260
Huh?

51
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,680
Big phony.

52
00:04:27,895 --> 00:04:30,678
So I guess all that about
being a tracker ninja

53
00:04:30,679 --> 00:04:33,721
protecting his village
was just a bunch of bull.

54
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:35,460
They look pretty chummy to me.

55
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:39,100
I'd say they've been pulling scams like
that for a long time.

56
00:04:39,475 --> 00:04:42,440
He's got some nerve facing us again after
pulling that one.

57
00:04:42,441 --> 00:04:44,780
And hiding behind a mask?

58
00:04:45,020 --> 00:04:46,560
Who does he think he's fooling?

59
00:04:46,835 --> 00:04:49,280
Speak for yourself, Sensei.

60
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,360
That's it.

61
00:04:51,510 --> 00:04:52,510
I'm taking him out.

62
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:55,520
Who does he think he's fooling?

63
00:04:56,140 --> 00:04:58,800
Hiding behind that mask like some sort of
clown?

64
00:04:59,280 --> 00:04:59,920
Sasuke!

65
00:05:00,260 --> 00:05:01,260
You're so cool!

66
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,300
Wait a second.

67
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:05,000
Didn't I just say that?

68
00:05:05,890 --> 00:05:06,890
She'll never change.

69
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,360
He's impressive.

70
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:10,960
Hmph.

71
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,242
Even though they were
just one tenth the strength of

72
00:05:14,243 --> 00:05:18,280
the original water clone
jutsu, he did destroy them all.

73
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,620
That move still gave us the first
advantage.

74
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,020
Now use it.

75
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,600
Right.

76
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:44,320
So you're Tazuna's daughter, huh?

77
00:05:44,540 --> 00:05:45,540
Too bad.

78
00:05:45,885 --> 00:05:47,205
You'll have to come with us, now.

79
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:04,740
Don't move!

80
00:06:06,820 --> 00:06:08,460
Shall we grab this one, too?

81
00:06:08,940 --> 00:06:09,460
No.

82
00:06:09,580 --> 00:06:11,360
Gato asked for just one hostage.

83
00:06:13,180 --> 00:06:14,180
Hostage!

84
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,520
Alright.

85
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,960
Then let's waste them!

86
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:20,700
Wait!

87
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,620
Please don't hurt my son.

88
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,900
I'm begging you, he's just a boy.

89
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:31,800
I'll do... anything.

90
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,820
Just please don't hurt him.

91
00:06:39,980 --> 00:06:42,560
Looks like your mom came through for you,
kid.

92
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:43,940
Lucky.

93
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,740
What a waste.

94
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,680
I was in the mood to cut something.

95
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,080
Give it a rest.

96
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:54,920
You already drew blood today.

97
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,420
Let's get her out of here.

98
00:07:05,685 --> 00:07:06,800
I'm sorry, mom!

99
00:07:08,250 --> 00:07:09,250
I'm sorry!

100
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:13,360
What... could I do?

101
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,640
I'm too weak to protect you!

102
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:24,260
I'm scared.

103
00:07:24,930 --> 00:07:25,930
I don't want to die!

104
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,160
Coward!

105
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:36,260
Listen to yourself, whining and
complaining like some sorry little victim!

106
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:39,460
You can whimper all day, for all I care!

107
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:41,220
You're just a coward!

108
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:43,100
You're just a coward!

109
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:46,580
You're just a coward!

110
00:07:46,581 --> 00:07:49,320
If you really care about something,
protect it.

111
00:07:49,340 --> 00:07:51,280
Even if you have to put your life on the
line.

112
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:52,600
Protect it.

113
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,100
With both arms.

114
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,320
Inari...

115
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:07,640
Father!

116
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:18,760
We're gonna treat you just fine, so
don't you worry your pretty little head.

117
00:08:19,225 --> 00:08:20,780
Come on, keep walking.

118
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:22,060
Stop!

119
00:08:23,110 --> 00:08:25,200
Well, well, if it ain't the little tough
guy.

120
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,840
Inari!

121
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,240
How cute.

122
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,920
You've come to save your mommy.

123
00:08:31,380 --> 00:08:34,159
You'd better get away from my mom!

124
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:35,700
Inari, no!

125
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:40,020
This kid's a little short on brains,
don't you think?

126
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:41,220
Take him down.

127
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,820
If you hurt him, I swear I'll...

128
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:48,640
Shut up.

129
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:49,720
Take him down.

130
00:08:52,380 --> 00:08:53,380
Inari...

131
00:09:01,540 --> 00:09:03,340
A substitution, Jutsu.

132
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,640
The woman!

133
00:09:04,784 --> 00:09:05,400
She's gone!

134
00:09:05,660 --> 00:09:06,840
Sorry I'm a little late.

135
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:07,900
Huh?

136
00:09:08,260 --> 00:09:09,260
Who's that?

137
00:09:11,980 --> 00:09:14,920
You know, heroes usually show up at the
last minute.

138
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:17,600
Naruto, it's you!

139
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,080
Who else?

140
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:21,800
Inari?

141
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,020
You did great.

142
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:24,080
Huh?

143
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:26,940
When you charged, they forgot about your
mom for a minute.

144
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:30,660
That gave me the chance to use a cool
Jutsu to get her away from them.

145
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:34,140
Naruto...

146
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:39,080
How did you know these samurai guys were
coming here?

147
00:09:40,220 --> 00:09:43,700
Uh... In the forest, I found a boar that
had been attacked.

148
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:46,000
And the trees were all cut up,
too.

149
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:48,900
Like someone had been practicing with a
sword or something.

150
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,740
The cuts led back toward the house.

151
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:53,840
So I followed them here.

152
00:09:55,340 --> 00:09:56,860
That was really smart.

153
00:09:57,300 --> 00:09:58,300
Blah blah.

154
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:01,800
It's one of those puny ninja brats Tazuna
hired.

155
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,080
Get him.

156
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,200
Yeah.

157
00:10:05,180 --> 00:10:06,180
They're coming!

158
00:10:10,020 --> 00:10:11,260
Try something else!

159
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,720
I did.

160
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:23,500
You did it!

161
00:10:24,529 --> 00:10:26,680
Hey, by the way, sorry about yesterday.

162
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:28,280
Huh?

163
00:10:30,115 --> 00:10:32,540
Calling you a coward was pretty mean,
I guess.

164
00:10:33,559 --> 00:10:35,140
Anyway, it's not true, you know.

165
00:10:37,149 --> 00:10:38,740
Because you were really brave.

166
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,080
Huh?

167
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:48,840
Darn it!

168
00:10:48,900 --> 00:10:52,100
I promised myself I wouldn't cry anymore!

169
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:59,160
You're gonna make fun of me again and call
me a baby!

170
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:00,980
But I can't stop!

171
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:05,560
You're happy.

172
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,200
What's wrong with that?

173
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,840
Hehehehehe.

174
00:11:09,900 --> 00:11:10,900
Huh?

175
00:11:13,660 --> 00:11:16,680
When you're happy, it's okay to cry.

176
00:11:16,780 --> 00:11:17,780
Really, it is.

177
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,440
Naruto!

178
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,600
Hehehehehe.

179
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:29,420
Hehehehehe.

180
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:33,340
Okay, I can leave you in charge of things
now, right?

181
00:11:34,660 --> 00:11:35,660
Yeah.

182
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:36,920
Good.

183
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:37,180
You can call me Tazuna.

184
00:11:37,181 --> 00:11:39,160
Then I'm going over to the bridge!

185
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,680
It's not easy being a hero!

186
00:11:43,460 --> 00:11:44,460
It's tough!

187
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,380
Believe it!

188
00:11:45,540 --> 00:11:46,540
Believe it!

189
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:56,000
So... he can keep up with Haku's speed,
huh?

190
00:11:57,840 --> 00:12:02,580
Sakura, cover Tazuna and stay close to me.

191
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:04,580
Let Sasuke handle this.

192
00:12:04,581 --> 00:12:07,540
We want the bridge builder, not you.

193
00:12:07,995 --> 00:12:10,940
If you back down, I won't have to kill
you.

194
00:12:11,650 --> 00:12:12,650
Save it.

195
00:12:13,580 --> 00:12:15,220
You're making a mistake.

196
00:12:15,990 --> 00:12:18,680
You won't be able to keep up with my
speed.

197
00:12:19,819 --> 00:12:22,120
I've gained two key advantages.

198
00:12:24,500 --> 00:12:25,100
Yeah?

199
00:12:25,101 --> 00:12:26,160
What are they?

200
00:12:27,660 --> 00:12:29,940
First, we're surrounded by water.

201
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:34,520
Second, I've blocked one of your hands.

202
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:40,180
Therefore, you only have one free hand to
defend yourself.

203
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:45,600
Hand signs with a single hand?

204
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:47,240
I've never seen that before.

205
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:50,360
Secret jutsu.

206
00:12:50,380 --> 00:12:52,060
A thousand needles of death.

207
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:58,700
He doesn't want to kill the kid.

208
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:02,880
Remember the training.

209
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,240
Focus.

210
00:13:04,580 --> 00:13:06,500
Summon my chakra at once.

211
00:13:17,190 --> 00:13:18,700
He vanished.

212
00:13:26,020 --> 00:13:27,940
You're not as fast as you think.

213
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:35,660
It's not possible.

214
00:13:35,661 --> 00:13:37,700
No one's faster than Haku.

215
00:13:39,049 --> 00:13:40,249
Thought you were quicker, huh?

216
00:13:40,919 --> 00:13:42,500
Now what else are you wrong about?

217
00:13:43,265 --> 00:13:47,700
You made a big mistake insulting these
ninja and calling them brats.

218
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:51,040
That's just guaranteed to bring out
Sasuke's attitude.

219
00:13:51,460 --> 00:13:54,220
And he's the best young fighter of the
Hidden Leaf Village.

220
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:58,480
And Sakura here is our sharpest mind.

221
00:13:59,280 --> 00:14:02,389
And last but not
least, our number one

222
00:14:02,390 --> 00:14:06,960
hyperactive knucklehead
ninja is Naruto Uzumaki.

223
00:14:12,159 --> 00:14:16,040
Haku, if we keep going like this,
we'll be the victims instead of them.

224
00:14:16,349 --> 00:14:17,349
Get on with it.

225
00:14:17,540 --> 00:14:18,540
Right.

226
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:23,400
What's that?

227
00:14:24,260 --> 00:14:26,200
I'm sorry it's come to this.

228
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:28,960
The air.

229
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,300
So cold.

230
00:14:42,860 --> 00:14:44,280
Secret jutsu.

231
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,480
Let's do this one!

232
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Mm...

233
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:25,680
Maybe.

234
00:15:25,681 --> 00:15:25,760
Well, it's gonna be Tracer!

235
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:27,120
I'm ready.

236
00:15:30,700 --> 00:15:34,500
If you enter this fight, you fight me.

237
00:15:36,820 --> 00:15:38,920
Now, we'll begin.

238
00:15:39,660 --> 00:15:43,400
And I'll show you what speed really means.

239
00:15:56,780 --> 00:16:00,500
Just try to help him, and I'll kill the
other two in a heartbeat.

240
00:16:10,100 --> 00:16:11,100
I'm sorry.

241
00:16:11,500 --> 00:16:13,260
I can't stay with you.

242
00:16:13,620 --> 00:16:14,620
Forgive me.

243
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:17,400
I understand.

244
00:16:18,180 --> 00:16:19,180
Go now.

245
00:16:19,820 --> 00:16:20,820
Take this!

246
00:16:31,515 --> 00:16:32,650
Ugh...

247
00:16:43,970 --> 00:16:46,230
What a fool.

248
00:16:46,510 --> 00:16:48,170
Such a show-off.

249
00:16:49,150 --> 00:16:53,470
Number one, hyperactive knucklehead ninja.

250
00:17:04,359 --> 00:17:05,560
Naruto Uzumaki!

251
00:17:06,069 --> 00:17:07,160
It's here!

252
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:08,040
Yeah!

253
00:17:08,140 --> 00:17:09,140
Believe it!

254
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:12,640
Naruto!

255
00:17:13,469 --> 00:17:15,668
You know how in stories
the hero usually shows

256
00:17:15,669 --> 00:17:17,780
up at the last minute
and then kicks butt?

257
00:17:18,169 --> 00:17:20,180
Well, that's what I'm gonna do right now!

258
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:21,380
Believe it!

259
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,300
This brat again.

260
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:26,599
What an idiot.

261
00:17:26,859 --> 00:17:31,060
If he'd have stayed hidden, he could have
been so much more effective.

262
00:17:34,699 --> 00:17:36,681
That boy... Alright!

263
00:17:37,260 --> 00:17:38,260
You're history!

264
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:39,540
I'll clone Jutsu!

265
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:40,880
No!

266
00:17:47,839 --> 00:17:50,220
Haku, what are you doing?

267
00:17:52,340 --> 00:17:56,960
Zabuza, this boy... let me fight him my
own way.

268
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:58,640
Please.

269
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:11,120
So you want me to leave this to you.

270
00:18:11,580 --> 00:18:12,780
Is that it, Haku?

271
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:18,640
As usual, you're too soft.

272
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:22,800
Forgive me.

273
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,400
Soft?

274
00:18:26,340 --> 00:18:27,340
He's right.

275
00:18:28,180 --> 00:18:29,440
Look at these wounds.

276
00:18:30,020 --> 00:18:35,140
He cut me up with his needles,
yet he didn't hit a single vital spot.

277
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:37,220
Why?

278
00:18:39,620 --> 00:18:40,620
It's impossible.

279
00:18:41,220 --> 00:18:43,100
Naruto can't match this kid.

280
00:18:43,940 --> 00:18:47,320
I've got to... Don't
even think about it.

281
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,880
You know the score, Kakashi.

282
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:54,460
If you go after Haku, I go after the
bridge builder.

283
00:18:56,340 --> 00:18:57,560
He's got me.

284
00:18:58,300 --> 00:18:59,480
Relax, Kakashi.

285
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,900
Sit back and enjoy the show.

286
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:03,700
Let's see how they do.

287
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,340
One on one.

288
00:19:06,860 --> 00:19:07,880
That mask!

289
00:19:08,419 --> 00:19:09,780
And your bogus story!

290
00:19:10,449 --> 00:19:12,060
You were with Zabuza all along!

291
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:14,820
You think you can get away with a stunt
like that?

292
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:17,340
I'm sorry.

293
00:19:18,739 --> 00:19:19,739
Deceiving your opponent?

294
00:19:20,499 --> 00:19:21,499
Catching them off guard?

295
00:19:22,334 --> 00:19:23,900
That is the art of the shinobi.

296
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:26,120
Please don't take it personally.

297
00:19:27,495 --> 00:19:30,640
And while you're jabbering, I'll catch you
off guard!

298
00:19:33,500 --> 00:19:35,380
I haven't forgotten about you.

299
00:19:36,204 --> 00:19:37,204
Not for an instant.

300
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:39,440
Sasuke?

301
00:19:40,330 --> 00:19:42,600
Some warriors accept defeat gracefully.

302
00:19:43,359 --> 00:19:44,599
They know when they are beaten.

303
00:19:45,244 --> 00:19:46,244
Others do not.

304
00:19:46,689 --> 00:19:47,380
So be it.

305
00:19:47,700 --> 00:19:49,580
Let us finish our battle then.

306
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:50,700
To the death!

307
00:19:51,589 --> 00:19:53,440
Wha... Hey, where are you going?

308
00:19:54,384 --> 00:19:55,600
It's alright, Naruto.

309
00:19:56,559 --> 00:19:57,680
We'll have our fight next.

310
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:00,460
Here he comes!

311
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:09,540
The real one is over there.

312
00:20:11,220 --> 00:20:12,600
I'm behind you.

313
00:20:15,700 --> 00:20:17,600
He transported himself!

314
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:19,320
In an instant!

315
00:20:19,540 --> 00:20:20,540
How?

316
00:20:26,840 --> 00:20:29,060
What kind of jutsu is this?

317
00:20:30,500 --> 00:20:34,500
Could it be... he has clones hiding in the
mirrors?

318
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:37,420
All throwing needles at the same time?

319
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:42,400
No, they're too fast for that.

320
00:20:42,740 --> 00:20:44,980
I can't even see where they're coming
from!

321
00:20:45,500 --> 00:20:50,320
And if it was just a clone jutsu... then
he wouldn't need them.

322
00:20:50,321 --> 00:20:51,580
In the ice mirrors...

323
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:58,880
If I attack him from here, and Naruto hits
him from the outside... we can do it.

324
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,120
Hey!

325
00:21:00,121 --> 00:21:01,840
I snuck in here to save you!

326
00:21:03,899 --> 00:21:05,480
Pretty cool move, huh, Sasuke?

327
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:09,240
You are a complete loser!

328
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:10,840
You're a shinobi!

329
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:12,400
Think carefully before you move!

330
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:13,860
What the heck's your problem?

331
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:16,060
You should thank me for coming in here to
help you!

332
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:19,800
Naruto, if we're both
inside here... Forget it!

333
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,600
I've had it with your mistakes!

334
00:21:22,060 --> 00:21:23,500
And I've had it with your attitude!

335
00:21:23,820 --> 00:21:24,480
Believe it!

336
00:21:24,740 --> 00:21:29,100
Naruto's building a solid reputation as
the most clueless ninja in history.

337
00:21:29,280 --> 00:21:31,920
The more he helps, the worse things get.

338
00:21:32,740 --> 00:21:33,480
That's it!

339
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:35,500
I'm gonna destroy these mirrors right now!

340
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:37,480
Fire style!

341
00:21:37,760 --> 00:21:39,360
Hey, what attack are you using?

342
00:21:39,540 --> 00:21:42,300
These mirrors are made of ice,
so how do you destroy ice?

343
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:43,520
Figure it out!

344
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:45,380
Fireball jutsu!

345
00:21:56,150 --> 00:21:58,290
That didn't do anything at all!

346
00:21:58,650 --> 00:22:01,330
You'll need much more heat than that to
melt this ice.

347
00:22:15,130 --> 00:22:16,430
Where is he?

348
00:22:16,610 --> 00:22:18,810
Where's the needle attack coming at us
from?

349
00:22:19,050 --> 00:22:20,050
Are they clones?

350
00:22:22,430 --> 00:22:24,170
We've gotta find the real one!

351
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:25,370
Which one is it?

352
00:22:25,570 --> 00:22:28,490
Look into every mirror as hard as you
like.

353
00:22:28,710 --> 00:22:30,310
You will never learn the secret.

354
00:22:31,230 --> 00:22:32,230
Oh yeah?

355
00:22:32,370 --> 00:22:33,930
Shadow Cloth Jutsu!

356
00:22:34,170 --> 00:22:34,410
No!

357
00:22:34,530 --> 00:22:35,530
Don't!

358
00:22:36,450 --> 00:22:37,890
You've got a hundred mirrors!

359
00:22:38,130 --> 00:22:40,330
Then a hundred of me will smash them all!

360
00:22:40,610 --> 00:22:42,450
Then I'll find where you really are!

361
00:22:44,130 --> 00:22:45,130
Jutsu!

362
00:22:45,530 --> 00:22:46,090
Jutsu!

363
00:22:46,091 --> 00:22:47,091
Jutsu!

364
00:22:47,610 --> 00:22:48,170
Jutsu!

365
00:22:48,550 --> 00:22:49,110
Jutsu!

366
00:22:49,111 --> 00:22:49,630
Jutsu!

367
00:22:49,631 --> 00:22:50,631
Jutsu!

368
00:22:56,830 --> 00:23:03,051
These mirrors only reflect my image, allowing
me to transport myself at light speed.

369
00:23:03,084 --> 00:23:07,230
Through my eyes, you appear to be moving
in slow motion.

370
00:23:09,059 --> 00:23:10,310
It's a Kekei Genkai!

371
00:23:13,139 --> 00:23:14,139
Kekei Genkai?

372
00:23:14,214 --> 00:23:15,214
What is it?

373
00:23:15,329 --> 00:23:16,450
It's like my Sharingan.

374
00:23:17,139 --> 00:23:18,150
You can't learn it.

375
00:23:18,190 --> 00:23:19,670
It has to be in your blood.

376
00:23:19,890 --> 00:23:26,371
In your genetic code passed down from
generation to generation within a single clan.

377
00:23:26,790 --> 00:23:28,930
Even I can't copy that Jutsu.

378
00:23:29,490 --> 00:23:34,990
I couldn't break through!

379
00:23:35,950 --> 00:23:37,070
So what?

380
00:23:37,290 --> 00:23:38,650
He's not gonna stop me!

381
00:23:39,610 --> 00:23:42,290
I'm not giving up and I'm not gonna lose
here!

382
00:23:42,730 --> 00:23:45,950
Cause I have a dream and no one's gonna
take it away from me!

383
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:48,530
Someday I'll be respected in my village!

384
00:23:48,690 --> 00:23:49,690
That's my dream!

385
00:23:49,890 --> 00:23:51,810
To be the greatest Hokage!

386
00:23:53,710 --> 00:23:54,710
Dreams...

387
00:23:55,930 --> 00:23:58,590
It was not my desire to be a Shinobi.

388
00:23:59,390 --> 00:24:00,390
It's painful.

389
00:24:02,110 --> 00:24:04,110
I don't want to kill you.

390
00:24:04,730 --> 00:24:08,690
But if you advance, I will have no choice.

391
00:24:09,530 --> 00:24:14,910
Then I will kill the kindness in my own
heart and fully embrace the Shinobi way.

392
00:24:15,510 --> 00:24:17,190
And there will be no mercy.

393
00:24:17,370 --> 00:24:18,650
No turning back.

394
00:24:19,370 --> 00:24:22,670
This bridge will be the battlefield where
our dreams collide.

395
00:24:23,450 --> 00:24:25,930
Now I must fight for my dream.

396
00:24:26,490 --> 00:24:28,450
Just as you fight for yours.

397
00:24:29,650 --> 00:24:31,150
Please do not blame me.

398
00:24:31,910 --> 00:24:34,550
I fight for someone who is precious to me.

399
00:24:34,870 --> 00:24:36,230
I live for him.

400
00:24:36,370 --> 00:24:38,250
And I face death for him.

401
00:24:38,590 --> 00:24:41,170
So that his dream may become reality.

402
00:24:41,730 --> 00:24:43,330
That is my dream.

403
00:24:43,331 --> 00:24:46,980
And for the sake of
that dream, if I must,

404
00:24:46,981 --> 00:24:50,151
I will act as a Shinobi
and take your lives.

405
00:24:54,610 --> 00:24:55,210
Sasuke!

406
00:24:55,250 --> 00:24:56,250
Naruto!

407
00:24:56,310 --> 00:24:57,790
Take this guy out!

408
00:24:57,830 --> 00:24:58,610
You can do it!

409
00:24:58,730 --> 00:24:59,410
Don't, Sakura.

410
00:24:59,650 --> 00:25:00,870
Don't push them.

411
00:25:01,230 --> 00:25:02,230
Huh?

412
00:25:02,944 --> 00:25:06,353
Even if they somehow
found a way to overcome the

413
00:25:06,354 --> 00:25:09,590
Mirojutsu, they still
couldn't defeat this ninja.

414
00:25:10,510 --> 00:25:12,750
But how can you be so sure?

415
00:25:15,290 --> 00:25:17,490
They have the desire to win.

416
00:25:17,690 --> 00:25:20,370
But they don't have the instinct to kill.

417
00:25:22,270 --> 00:25:23,270
Exactly.

418
00:25:24,450 --> 00:25:26,930
Your village has become complacent.

419
00:25:26,970 --> 00:25:30,270
Your trainees never learn the most
important lesson of all.

420
00:25:30,550 --> 00:25:33,110
To kill the feelings in their own hearts.

421
00:25:33,290 --> 00:25:35,510
To crush an opponent mercilessly.

422
00:25:35,530 --> 00:25:38,230
To destroy with no emotion or regret.

423
00:25:38,231 --> 00:25:41,210
It's me or Zabuza here and now.

424
00:25:41,450 --> 00:25:44,010
I'll have to do this the hard way.

425
00:25:45,170 --> 00:25:46,470
Shot and gun.

426
00:25:48,069 --> 00:25:49,410
You're no fun, Kakashi.

427
00:25:49,610 --> 00:25:51,290
Using the same old trick.

428
00:25:56,930 --> 00:26:01,450
If it's just an old trick, why did you
just stop me?

429
00:26:04,490 --> 00:26:07,710
Let your opponent see your jutsu too many
times.

430
00:26:07,711 --> 00:26:10,210
And he'll find a way to use it against
you.

431
00:26:10,919 --> 00:26:12,190
Then count yourself lucky.

432
00:26:12,510 --> 00:26:15,790
You're the only man alive who's seen my
Sharingan twice.

433
00:26:17,210 --> 00:26:18,210
Show's over.

434
00:26:18,490 --> 00:26:20,290
There won't be a third time.

435
00:26:20,760 --> 00:26:25,470
Even if you did defeat me, you'd have no
chance against Haku.

436
00:26:26,209 --> 00:26:28,390
When I found him, he was just a street
kid.

437
00:26:29,154 --> 00:26:31,950
But I trained him in the most advanced
ninja techniques.

438
00:26:33,170 --> 00:26:34,170
...

439
00:26:34,850 --> 00:26:36,491
... ...

440
00:26:37,050 --> 00:26:38,050
...

441
00:26:43,100 --> 00:26:44,100
...

442
00:26:50,580 --> 00:26:52,460
I taught him everything I know.

443
00:26:57,640 --> 00:27:02,240
Plus, he had special abilities that he
refined on his own.

444
00:27:04,040 --> 00:27:07,440
In the end, his power surpassed even mine.

445
00:27:07,441 --> 00:27:12,340
His bloodline trait, the Kekkei Genkai,
cannot be defeated by anyone.

446
00:27:12,840 --> 00:27:17,220
I've created a tool that can destroy
anything that stands in my way.

447
00:27:18,149 --> 00:27:19,149
He's the ultimate.

448
00:27:19,499 --> 00:27:20,800
A battle tool of destruction.

449
00:27:21,599 --> 00:27:22,780
Are you finished bragging?

450
00:27:22,880 --> 00:27:24,500
You're starting to put me to sleep.

451
00:27:25,119 --> 00:27:26,119
Let's finish this.

452
00:27:26,280 --> 00:27:27,280
Now!

453
00:27:27,980 --> 00:27:28,580
Fine.

454
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:30,600
But there's one more thing you should
know.

455
00:27:30,760 --> 00:27:33,000
A little more bragging, as you say.

456
00:27:37,340 --> 00:27:39,100
I know you need me, Zabuza.

457
00:27:39,280 --> 00:27:40,880
I'll finish them off quickly.

458
00:27:42,020 --> 00:27:43,880
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

459
00:27:45,600 --> 00:27:48,220
He just won't give up.

460
00:27:50,460 --> 00:27:52,640
... ...

461
00:27:54,320 --> 00:27:56,280
... ...

462
00:27:57,940 --> 00:28:02,241
... ... ... ...

463
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:11,180
He read my movements.

464
00:28:11,620 --> 00:28:13,220
But that's not possible.

465
00:28:19,380 --> 00:28:21,080
Got him that time.

466
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:23,080
I'm starting to get the timing.

467
00:28:23,380 --> 00:28:26,180
I was so close, but I couldn't quite get
to him.

468
00:28:26,360 --> 00:28:28,740
Naruto, can you do it again?

469
00:28:28,741 --> 00:28:29,741
Huh?

470
00:28:29,840 --> 00:28:30,640
Of course!

471
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:31,640
Nothing can stop me!

472
00:28:31,700 --> 00:28:32,700
Believe it!

473
00:28:32,870 --> 00:28:35,520
He doesn't want to show it, but he's
exhausted.

474
00:28:35,940 --> 00:28:38,680
The Shadow Clone Jutsu uses up so much
chakra.

475
00:28:39,580 --> 00:28:42,060
But thanks to him, I figured it out.

476
00:28:42,300 --> 00:28:45,240
The human eye cannot track my movements.

477
00:28:46,320 --> 00:28:47,960
It must have been a coincidence.

478
00:28:52,220 --> 00:28:52,740
Naruto!

479
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:53,620
Run for it!

480
00:28:53,880 --> 00:28:56,300
Get out of here and attack from the
outside!

481
00:28:56,620 --> 00:28:57,020
Hurry!

482
00:28:57,021 --> 00:28:59,400
Uh, all right!

483
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:00,440
You got it!

484
00:29:01,120 --> 00:29:02,780
You cannot escape!

485
00:29:14,680 --> 00:29:16,980
You think you can keep me here?

486
00:29:17,060 --> 00:29:18,060
Forget it!

487
00:29:20,160 --> 00:29:20,860
That's it!

488
00:29:21,100 --> 00:29:22,100
Fire Style!

489
00:29:22,260 --> 00:29:23,420
Fireball Jutsu!

490
00:29:30,860 --> 00:29:32,180
Fireball Jutsu!

491
00:29:43,520 --> 00:29:45,820
I couldn't get past him!

492
00:29:46,560 --> 00:29:48,180
That was good, Naruto!

493
00:29:48,600 --> 00:29:49,600
Huh?

494
00:29:50,080 --> 00:29:51,560
One more time?

495
00:29:52,260 --> 00:29:52,980
Yeah!

496
00:29:53,200 --> 00:29:54,200
Let's do it!

497
00:29:54,840 --> 00:29:57,280
There must be a limit to his chakra,
too.

498
00:29:57,480 --> 00:29:59,280
I can feel him slowing down.

499
00:29:59,780 --> 00:30:01,260
No more games.

500
00:30:01,520 --> 00:30:03,420
I need to stop this now!

501
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:05,400
This time you'll stay down!

502
00:30:10,580 --> 00:30:13,378
I've been waiting to see
the look on your face when

503
00:30:13,379 --> 00:30:16,061
you realize your Sharingan
has become worthless.

504
00:30:16,960 --> 00:30:20,720
You once said the same jutsu won't work on
me twice.

505
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:23,440
Well, now I'm telling you that.

506
00:30:23,441 --> 00:30:24,441
Huh?

507
00:30:24,500 --> 00:30:25,640
Ninja Art.

508
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:27,760
Hidden Mist Jutsu.

509
00:30:36,220 --> 00:30:37,300
This is it.

510
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:41,380
Sakura, stay with Tazuna.

511
00:30:41,740 --> 00:30:45,260
Oh, Sakura.

512
00:30:47,220 --> 00:30:50,760
Follow my lead, Mr. Tazuna, and whatever
happens, stay close!

513
00:30:51,080 --> 00:30:51,560
All right.

514
00:30:51,740 --> 00:30:53,240
I'll stay right behind you.

515
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:55,080
It's the Hidden Mist Jutsu.

516
00:30:55,120 --> 00:30:58,400
But this mist is too thick even for
Zabuza.

517
00:30:58,520 --> 00:30:59,980
How can he fight in it?

518
00:31:05,280 --> 00:31:06,560
Very skillful.

519
00:31:06,620 --> 00:31:09,460
As I'd expect from Kakashi, the Sharingan
warrior.

520
00:31:12,160 --> 00:31:13,760
His eyes are closed.

521
00:31:14,580 --> 00:31:19,180
But next time you see me will be the last
time you see anything.

522
00:31:19,840 --> 00:31:22,960
Without your Sharingan, you're nothing.

523
00:31:22,961 --> 00:31:24,200
What?

524
00:31:26,080 --> 00:31:29,080
You wanted me to believe you could see
through anything.

525
00:31:29,460 --> 00:31:30,900
Even through time.

526
00:31:31,220 --> 00:31:33,040
But your prediction was wrong.

527
00:31:33,360 --> 00:31:34,500
I'm still alive.

528
00:31:35,060 --> 00:31:37,240
So you're a fraud, Kakashi.

529
00:31:37,500 --> 00:31:40,140
You can't read the future, and you can't
read me.

530
00:31:40,540 --> 00:31:44,900
Now that I know this, a very simple plan
can defeat you.

531
00:31:45,220 --> 00:31:49,260
First, neutralize your piercing eye with
Zero Visibility Mist.

532
00:31:49,580 --> 00:31:49,940
Ah!

533
00:31:50,120 --> 00:31:50,540
Ah!

534
00:31:51,120 --> 00:31:51,240
Ah!

535
00:31:51,241 --> 00:31:53,640
By keeping my own eyes closed.

536
00:31:54,060 --> 00:31:57,840
You can't bore into my mind if you can't
look into my eyes.

537
00:31:58,900 --> 00:31:59,540
Brilliant.

538
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:03,680
Except with your eyes closed, you can't
see me either.

539
00:32:04,020 --> 00:32:06,040
Have you forgotten who I am, Kakashi?

540
00:32:06,300 --> 00:32:09,960
I'm the demon of the Hidden Mist,
master of the Silent Kill.

541
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:12,100
I can take you out by sound alone.

542
00:32:15,780 --> 00:32:19,360
It's been a long time since I faced anyone
this tough.

543
00:32:19,361 --> 00:32:22,140
And Sasuke and Naruto.

544
00:32:22,500 --> 00:32:24,780
I don't know if they can hold out.

545
00:32:25,740 --> 00:32:27,140
Stay calm.

546
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:28,720
Think.

547
00:32:28,880 --> 00:32:30,940
Where will he strike?

548
00:32:32,100 --> 00:32:34,000
The bridge builder!

549
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:41,000
Too late!

550
00:32:41,001 --> 00:32:42,001
.

551
00:32:48,580 --> 00:32:51,080
That scream... that was Sakura.

552
00:32:52,040 --> 00:32:53,660
What's happening to her?

553
00:32:54,120 --> 00:32:55,300
Where's Kakashi?

554
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:02,440
Sakura... she's in trouble.

555
00:33:03,540 --> 00:33:05,440
Naruto, are you able to get up?

556
00:33:06,705 --> 00:33:09,240
Try not to use any more chakra.

557
00:33:09,241 --> 00:33:11,480
That's only going to help him now.

558
00:33:13,469 --> 00:33:14,469
I know, Sasuke.

559
00:33:14,520 --> 00:33:15,520
I know.

560
00:33:17,220 --> 00:33:18,940
We can't go on like this.

561
00:33:19,160 --> 00:33:20,940
He's blocking every move we make.

562
00:33:21,260 --> 00:33:23,400
I've got to find a way to outmaneuver him.

563
00:33:26,619 --> 00:33:28,360
My eyes have adjusted to his movements.

564
00:33:28,979 --> 00:33:30,540
Looking for a counterattack?

565
00:33:31,240 --> 00:33:32,680
I'll save you the trouble.

566
00:33:36,680 --> 00:33:37,680
What?

567
00:33:40,820 --> 00:33:41,920
Get up, loser!

568
00:33:42,260 --> 00:33:43,300
We've got to team up!

569
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:47,880
I'm aiming at his vital spots now.

570
00:33:48,240 --> 00:33:50,140
But I can't get a direct hit.

571
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:55,120
I know what we have to do.

572
00:33:55,240 --> 00:33:56,360
Believe it, Sasuke!

573
00:34:01,060 --> 00:34:02,440
It's not just luck.

574
00:34:02,640 --> 00:34:04,340
He's fighting to protect his friend.

575
00:34:04,520 --> 00:34:05,880
That's why he's so determined.

576
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:08,420
But he can't possibly see the needles
coming.

577
00:34:10,100 --> 00:34:12,520
And yet, he's tracking them.

578
00:34:13,020 --> 00:34:14,020
Somehow.

579
00:34:15,120 --> 00:34:18,860
Whatever he's doing, I've got to stop him
now.

580
00:34:20,500 --> 00:34:21,500
He disappeared!

581
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:22,820
Where'd he go?

582
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:24,380
How could he just vanish?

583
00:34:24,679 --> 00:34:26,880
Naruto, you'd better not pass out again.

584
00:34:27,159 --> 00:34:28,300
Come on, let's go!

585
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:30,100
I can't keep protecting you like this!

586
00:34:30,380 --> 00:34:31,620
Well, then don't!

587
00:34:31,621 --> 00:34:33,260
I never asked for your help!

588
00:34:35,880 --> 00:34:37,560
You can't revive him.

589
00:34:37,561 --> 00:34:39,340
He's reached his limits.

590
00:34:45,219 --> 00:34:47,580
Your attacks are very skillful.

591
00:34:49,719 --> 00:34:52,380
But you've reached your limits as well.

592
00:34:54,820 --> 00:34:55,940
Stay calm.

593
00:34:57,640 --> 00:34:58,640
Focus.

594
00:35:12,640 --> 00:35:14,440
He saw every move.

595
00:35:15,320 --> 00:35:19,600
But... there's no way he could do that.

596
00:35:29,090 --> 00:35:29,890
Impossible.

597
00:35:29,891 --> 00:35:31,090
Those eyes.

598
00:35:33,410 --> 00:35:35,030
The Shotting Gun.

599
00:35:39,390 --> 00:35:41,830
Your... It's not complete.

600
00:35:42,250 --> 00:35:44,770
But I could see through his deceptions.

601
00:35:45,830 --> 00:35:50,350
So, even now, his eyes are tracking me.

602
00:35:53,510 --> 00:35:55,530
I can't target him directly.

603
00:35:55,730 --> 00:35:57,570
He'll just block a frontal attack.

604
00:35:57,850 --> 00:36:02,050
So I'll have to throw him off guard by
attacking his partner.

605
00:36:03,010 --> 00:36:04,890
Then I'll destroy him.

606
00:36:05,850 --> 00:36:06,850
What?

607
00:36:07,350 --> 00:36:08,810
I've got to stop him!

608
00:36:14,180 --> 00:36:19,080
You let your concern for those little
punks' safety cloud your mind,

609
00:36:19,300 --> 00:36:23,260
adding further to the fog that already
hinders your Shotting Gun.

610
00:36:24,300 --> 00:36:26,340
Your eyes are sharp, Kakashi.

611
00:36:26,580 --> 00:36:29,260
But not sharp enough to read my moves.

612
00:36:29,760 --> 00:36:30,840
Not anymore.

613
00:36:33,820 --> 00:36:35,480
Come on, Kakashi.

614
00:36:35,481 --> 00:36:37,020
I want this to be fun.

615
00:36:37,300 --> 00:36:40,480
I want to enjoy myself as I exact my
revenge.

616
00:36:40,900 --> 00:36:43,620
As for those brats... don't worry.

617
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:45,380
They're at Haku's mercy.

618
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:48,440
No, they're breathing their last breaths.

619
00:36:48,620 --> 00:36:49,620
Right now.

620
00:36:51,740 --> 00:36:52,740
Relax.

621
00:36:52,860 --> 00:36:56,092
You'll have plenty of time
to weep out an apology for

622
00:36:56,093 --> 00:36:58,960
failing those brats when
you see them in the next life.

623
00:37:00,640 --> 00:37:01,640
Hahahaha!

624
00:37:02,380 --> 00:37:03,060
Hahahaha!

625
00:37:03,320 --> 00:37:04,000
Hahahaha!

626
00:37:04,001 --> 00:37:05,001
Hahahaha!

627
00:37:15,680 --> 00:37:18,520
He said Sasuke... will die!

628
00:37:20,940 --> 00:37:22,500
No, I won't believe that!

629
00:37:22,680 --> 00:37:24,140
I have faith in him!

630
00:37:24,420 --> 00:37:26,080
Sasuke will beat them to a pulp!

631
00:37:26,240 --> 00:37:26,380
Cha!

632
00:37:26,760 --> 00:37:28,180
And that masked kid?

633
00:37:28,440 --> 00:37:30,220
They'll make him wish that he was never
born!

634
00:37:30,600 --> 00:37:32,020
I can't lose Sasuke!

635
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:34,960
Anyone who tries to take him from me will
pay for it!

636
00:37:34,961 --> 00:37:36,980
I... and Naruto, either!

637
00:37:37,320 --> 00:37:38,320
Exactly.

638
00:37:42,300 --> 00:37:45,260
I... I believe in their abilities.

639
00:37:45,620 --> 00:37:47,460
I have faith in them.

640
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:53,320
Naruto, the number one hyperactive
knucklehead ninja.

641
00:37:54,760 --> 00:38:00,260
And Sasuke, heir to the most powerful clan
in the Hidden Leaf Village.

642
00:38:02,360 --> 00:38:04,961
You mean... Yes.

643
00:38:05,020 --> 00:38:08,220
His full name is Sasuke Uchiha.

644
00:38:08,620 --> 00:38:11,980
The Kekkei Genkai is his birthright.

645
00:38:12,360 --> 00:38:17,580
I heard that one young ninja survived the
tragedy of the Uchiha clan.

646
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:20,100
No wonder he advances so quickly.

647
00:38:21,600 --> 00:38:24,040
But... so does Haku.

648
00:38:24,260 --> 00:38:26,080
No one can match him.

649
00:38:27,680 --> 00:38:30,620
No one has ever stopped his secret jutsu.

650
00:38:30,760 --> 00:38:33,800
Even the most skilled Jonin fall before
him.

651
00:38:34,840 --> 00:38:37,420
Just as you will fall before me!

652
00:38:37,940 --> 00:38:38,940
Right now!

653
00:38:42,670 --> 00:38:43,490
He's right.

654
00:38:43,590 --> 00:38:44,770
It's time to end this.

655
00:38:44,910 --> 00:38:46,310
But he is the one who will fall!

656
00:38:58,270 --> 00:39:01,410
You always... get in the way, Naruto.

657
00:39:01,411 --> 00:39:03,530
It never fails.

658
00:39:03,790 --> 00:39:05,630
You beat him, Sasuke!

659
00:39:16,240 --> 00:39:18,900
You should see the look on your face.

660
00:39:21,560 --> 00:39:24,620
You... you look like a total loser.

661
00:39:26,300 --> 00:39:30,500
Why... why did you... save me?

662
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:32,320
Why did you do it?

663
00:39:33,260 --> 00:39:35,000
I don't know why.

664
00:39:35,080 --> 00:39:37,960
I... I just did.

665
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:47,220
And my future dream is... to be the
greatest Hokage!

666
00:39:47,520 --> 00:39:49,696
Then the whole village
will stop disrespecting

667
00:39:49,697 --> 00:39:51,901
me and start treating
me like I'm somebody!

668
00:39:52,020 --> 00:39:53,020
Get up, loser!

669
00:39:53,460 --> 00:39:55,400
We climbed all the way to the top!

670
00:39:55,720 --> 00:39:56,740
I want some more!

671
00:39:56,820 --> 00:39:58,156
Why are they so obsessed with him?

672
00:39:58,180 --> 00:39:58,440
Yes.

673
00:39:58,520 --> 00:40:00,020
Now it's mine.

674
00:40:00,080 --> 00:40:01,620
And Sasuke was so cool!

675
00:40:01,720 --> 00:40:03,840
Like he'd done this a thousand times!

676
00:40:03,841 --> 00:40:04,841
Sasuke!

677
00:40:13,300 --> 00:40:16,440
You... I hated you.

678
00:40:17,420 --> 00:40:18,560
Then why?

679
00:40:18,900 --> 00:40:20,620
It doesn't make any sense.

680
00:40:20,980 --> 00:40:23,780
Why did you... protect me?

681
00:40:25,500 --> 00:40:26,500
I don't know.

682
00:40:27,180 --> 00:40:29,440
My body just moved.

683
00:40:29,640 --> 00:40:31,840
There was no time to think.

684
00:40:31,841 --> 00:40:35,180
I... I... I'm...

685
00:40:36,680 --> 00:40:37,680
I'm... a loser!

686
00:40:39,620 --> 00:40:40,620
Sasuke!

687
00:40:42,780 --> 00:40:45,660
He... he's still out there...

688
00:40:47,235 --> 00:40:51,540
My brother... I promised myself...

689
00:40:53,380 --> 00:40:59,720
I'd... stay alive... until... I killed
him.

690
00:41:03,760 --> 00:41:07,800
Naruto, don't let... your dream die.

691
00:41:40,620 --> 00:41:45,000
He was a true ninja, worthy of honor.

692
00:41:47,420 --> 00:41:51,460
Is this the first time you have seen a
friend die in battle?

693
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:55,140
This is part of what it means to be a
ninja.

694
00:41:59,660 --> 00:42:00,660
Shut up!

695
00:42:14,500 --> 00:42:15,400
I'm gonna kill you!

696
00:42:15,420 --> 00:42:16,420
I'm gonna kill you!

697
00:42:24,420 --> 00:42:26,000
What is this chakra?

698
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:34,420
Chakra cannot be seen, yet it's clearly
visible.

699
00:42:35,940 --> 00:42:37,640
It's something ghastly.

700
00:42:37,780 --> 00:42:42,100
I can feel the wrath, the bloodlust,
like evil itself.

701
00:42:54,990 --> 00:42:58,550
His hand is healing, and changing.

702
00:43:00,470 --> 00:43:03,770
This boy, what is he?

703
00:43:13,030 --> 00:43:14,810
There's no way.

704
00:43:15,330 --> 00:43:17,070
What is this energy?

705
00:43:18,090 --> 00:43:19,370
Something foul.

706
00:43:20,290 --> 00:43:21,290
Kakashi?

707
00:43:21,390 --> 00:43:21,890
Kakashi?

708
00:43:22,170 --> 00:43:24,730
No... It's too powerful, even for him!

709
00:43:25,010 --> 00:43:26,950
Where is it coming from?

710
00:43:29,450 --> 00:43:32,930
Now you have seen all.

711
00:43:33,890 --> 00:43:36,030
One more time... Makes a good
use of this powerful energy...

712
00:43:36,031 --> 00:43:37,510
Must spend him a day in jail.

713
00:43:37,630 --> 00:43:39,471
Hang in there... MISCHIEVES!

714
00:43:55,130 --> 00:43:56,450
Bloodlust in his eyes.

715
00:43:57,310 --> 00:43:59,590
This is no longer a child.

716
00:44:09,510 --> 00:44:12,410
His chakra grows stronger every second.

717
00:44:12,630 --> 00:44:14,690
I must strike now!

718
00:44:26,210 --> 00:44:27,230
Now!

719
00:44:27,690 --> 00:44:28,710
Now!

720
00:44:33,280 --> 00:44:34,280
Impossible!

721
00:44:39,350 --> 00:44:40,350
Those eyes!

722
00:44:45,170 --> 00:44:46,610
Could it be?

723
00:44:46,810 --> 00:44:48,370
The seal has been broken?

724
00:44:50,010 --> 00:44:50,650
No.

725
00:44:50,830 --> 00:44:53,165
It's been loosened,
and a glimmer of the

726
00:44:53,166 --> 00:44:55,450
Nine-Tailed Fox's chakra
has slipped through.

727
00:44:55,690 --> 00:44:57,670
But the seal still holds.

728
00:45:00,630 --> 00:45:01,270
Good.

729
00:45:01,450 --> 00:45:03,250
Then maybe we still have a chance.

730
00:45:06,130 --> 00:45:07,410
Just maybe.

731
00:45:10,030 --> 00:45:12,650
Zabuza, I don't mean to spoil your fun.

732
00:45:12,850 --> 00:45:15,270
I know how you like to stretch these
things out.

733
00:45:15,450 --> 00:45:17,710
But how about we put an end to this now?

734
00:45:21,915 --> 00:45:23,370
Come on, what do you say?

735
00:45:23,530 --> 00:45:24,750
We're both busy people.

736
00:45:26,490 --> 00:45:27,110
Tempting.

737
00:45:27,450 --> 00:45:31,370
I'm curious to see how you intend to back
up such brave words.

738
00:45:31,750 --> 00:45:33,070
Show me, Kakashi!

739
00:45:39,270 --> 00:45:40,850
I can't!

740
00:45:40,950 --> 00:45:43,210
His energy is too strong!

741
00:45:51,210 --> 00:45:57,420
That's no excuse.

742
00:45:57,860 --> 00:46:03,420
I are kimchi, but it's over.

743
00:46:21,960 --> 00:46:22,960
I'm still a child!

744
00:46:27,890 --> 00:46:31,350
Zabuza... I am no match for this boy.

745
00:46:31,351 --> 00:46:32,351
Boy...

746
00:46:37,180 --> 00:46:42,900
Master... I have failed.

747
00:46:57,380 --> 00:47:00,280
So, that guy in the woods, that was you?

748
00:47:03,595 --> 00:47:05,080
Why do you not strike?

749
00:47:06,645 --> 00:47:10,140
Did you not just vow to avenge your
comrade's death by killing me?

750
00:47:10,141 --> 00:47:12,840
Or was that vow just empty words?

751
00:47:29,415 --> 00:47:32,060
And no, that won't do.

752
00:47:33,080 --> 00:47:34,120
You're still holding back.

753
00:47:34,870 --> 00:47:38,120
If that is all the strength you can put
into it, you will never keep your vow.

754
00:47:39,325 --> 00:47:42,480
Perhaps he didn't mean as much to you as
you pretend.

755
00:47:45,320 --> 00:47:47,800
Is there anyone who's important to you?

756
00:47:48,890 --> 00:47:51,240
There is only one person who matters to
me.

757
00:47:51,560 --> 00:47:54,020
And I live to protect and serve him.

758
00:47:54,380 --> 00:47:55,680
That is my purpose.

759
00:47:57,634 --> 00:48:01,220
To show mercy to those who oppose the one
you serve?

760
00:48:02,000 --> 00:48:06,240
To allow his enemies to live, when you
could strike them down?

761
00:48:06,920 --> 00:48:08,480
This is not compassion.

762
00:48:09,160 --> 00:48:12,020
It is a betrayal of your life's very
purpose.

763
00:48:12,760 --> 00:48:15,100
For what reason do you exist, then?

764
00:48:15,700 --> 00:48:17,340
You're of use to no one.

765
00:48:17,700 --> 00:48:19,700
Your life has no meaning.

766
00:48:19,960 --> 00:48:21,700
It is mere existence.

767
00:48:22,440 --> 00:48:26,680
Day after day of pain and struggle,
signifying nothing.

768
00:48:26,980 --> 00:48:28,340
Yeah, well, speak for yourself!

769
00:48:28,840 --> 00:48:32,740
Are you really that blind little one I am
speaking of myself?

770
00:48:32,741 --> 00:48:37,120
This day has shown that I am no longer of
any use to Zabuza.

771
00:48:38,040 --> 00:48:39,040
Zabuza?

772
00:48:39,180 --> 00:48:40,740
Why that guy, anyway?

773
00:48:41,100 --> 00:48:45,160
To devote your life to a rotten skunk who
doesn't know the meaning of the word honor?

774
00:48:45,360 --> 00:48:47,794
If he's really the one
person that matters to you,

775
00:48:47,795 --> 00:48:50,361
man, that's the sorriest
thing I've ever heard!

776
00:48:50,660 --> 00:48:53,260
There were once others who mattered to me.

777
00:48:53,780 --> 00:48:54,780
Long ago.

778
00:48:57,740 --> 00:48:58,740
My father.

779
00:48:59,480 --> 00:49:00,740
And my mother.

780
00:49:04,100 --> 00:49:06,578
I was born in the land
of water, in a small

781
00:49:06,579 --> 00:49:09,101
village where the snow
lies deep in the winter.

782
00:49:09,620 --> 00:49:11,980
My parents were farmers and very poor.

783
00:49:12,300 --> 00:49:14,900
Our life was hard, but we were content.

784
00:49:15,220 --> 00:49:18,020
My parents were good to each other and
kind to me.

785
00:49:20,320 --> 00:49:22,500
Yes, we were happy once.

786
00:49:23,220 --> 00:49:25,020
But then everything changed.

787
00:49:29,510 --> 00:49:34,350
Because of something that happened long
before I was even born, everything changed.

788
00:49:34,351 --> 00:49:36,030
What do you mean?

789
00:49:36,425 --> 00:49:37,270
What was it?

790
00:49:37,340 --> 00:49:38,340
What happened?

791
00:49:39,450 --> 00:49:40,550
It wasn't my doing.

792
00:49:44,565 --> 00:49:45,660
It is in the blood.

793
00:49:46,460 --> 00:49:47,460
Blood?

794
00:49:49,780 --> 00:49:50,860
So what was it?

795
00:49:51,000 --> 00:49:53,440
You said something happened that changed
everything!

796
00:49:55,990 --> 00:49:58,280
It was... my father who changed.

797
00:49:59,100 --> 00:50:01,180
He killed my mother and he almost killed
me.

798
00:50:01,440 --> 00:50:07,780
After years of suffering the horrors of
civil war, the people of my land had come

799
00:50:07,781 --> 00:50:12,060
to fear and hate anyone who carried the
Kekkei Genkai in their blood.

800
00:50:12,240 --> 00:50:13,560
Kekkei Genkai?

801
00:50:14,200 --> 00:50:16,620
The advanced bloodline trait of a clan.

802
00:50:17,205 --> 00:50:21,460
Its jutsu and abilities passed down from
generation to generation.

803
00:50:22,100 --> 00:50:26,140
Because of their unique abilities,
the clans were used as mercenaries.

804
00:50:26,780 --> 00:50:29,080
They fought in many battles and were much
feared.

805
00:50:29,360 --> 00:50:34,160
But when the wars were over, they were
despised and shunned by the people who

806
00:50:34,161 --> 00:50:37,900
feared their presence would only bring
more war and misfortune.

807
00:50:41,820 --> 00:50:45,923
So it was that after the wars
these clans went into hiding,

808
00:50:45,924 --> 00:50:49,080
denying the bloodline trait
that flowed in their veins.

809
00:50:50,100 --> 00:50:55,401
Concealing their unique abilities, knowing
that to be discovered meant certain death.

810
00:50:56,020 --> 00:51:00,600
If you had searched that boy's memories,
I'm sure you would have found it there too.

811
00:51:00,840 --> 00:51:02,660
The cruelty of people.

812
00:51:02,880 --> 00:51:05,260
Their fear of things they don't
understand.

813
00:51:07,280 --> 00:51:11,080
For years, my mother was successful in
hiding her bloodline trait.

814
00:51:11,520 --> 00:51:13,960
She met and fell in love with a simple
farmer.

815
00:51:14,600 --> 00:51:15,780
And they were married.

816
00:51:16,100 --> 00:51:18,748
And after that, my mother
thought she would lead

817
00:51:18,749 --> 00:51:21,261
a peaceful, ordinary life
to the end of her days.

818
00:51:22,300 --> 00:51:23,880
Mama, look what I can do!

819
00:51:26,640 --> 00:51:28,100
See what I made?

820
00:51:28,360 --> 00:51:29,360
See?

821
00:51:30,760 --> 00:51:31,940
Isn't it beautiful?

822
00:51:32,620 --> 00:51:32,800
No!

823
00:51:33,060 --> 00:51:34,060
You must never!

824
00:51:34,360 --> 00:51:35,160
Do you hear?

825
00:51:35,240 --> 00:51:35,640
Never!

826
00:51:36,240 --> 00:51:37,540
You wicked, wicked child!

827
00:51:37,980 --> 00:51:38,580
Mama!

828
00:51:38,600 --> 00:51:39,540
What is it?

829
00:51:39,580 --> 00:51:40,140
Stop!

830
00:51:40,260 --> 00:51:41,260
Mama!

831
00:51:44,940 --> 00:51:46,500
Oh, I'm sorry.

832
00:51:46,920 --> 00:51:48,700
I'm sorry, my darling.

833
00:51:49,220 --> 00:51:50,220
I'm sorry.

834
00:51:53,340 --> 00:51:55,060
My father had seen.

835
00:51:55,420 --> 00:51:58,380
And so he knew our secret, my mother's and
mine.

836
00:52:10,180 --> 00:52:11,120
But please, don't.

837
00:52:11,160 --> 00:52:12,160
But please, don't.

838
00:52:26,040 --> 00:52:26,900
You must not tell this to my mother.

839
00:52:26,901 --> 00:52:26,920
And my mother must know it.

840
00:52:26,921 --> 00:52:29,920
When I am born, you must show me your true
identity.

841
00:52:30,320 --> 00:52:30,740
What is it?

842
00:52:30,741 --> 00:52:31,741
Yes, I love you too!

843
00:52:53,640 --> 00:53:01,640
A little pause...
and we are back.

844
00:53:01,641 --> 00:53:05,620
When at last I was myself again,
I was no longer myself.

845
00:53:06,600 --> 00:53:09,360
My father and mother
were gone, but I knew

846
00:53:09,361 --> 00:53:12,241
that something else
had been taken from me.

847
00:53:12,870 --> 00:53:13,870
My purpose.

848
00:53:14,295 --> 00:53:17,160
In all the world, there was no one who
needed me.

849
00:53:17,530 --> 00:53:19,160
I was... unnecessary.

850
00:53:21,040 --> 00:53:22,520
Just like... me!

851
00:53:23,600 --> 00:53:26,140
Why is it you're so determined to be
Hokage?

852
00:53:26,629 --> 00:53:28,891
Because you want all
eyes in your village to

853
00:53:28,892 --> 00:53:31,861
look on you and recognize
you as a great ninja.

854
00:53:32,730 --> 00:53:34,882
You see, it is only
through the eyes of others

855
00:53:34,883 --> 00:53:36,760
that our little lives
have any significance.

856
00:53:36,940 --> 00:53:38,780
When there is no one
who sees you or will

857
00:53:38,781 --> 00:53:42,101
even look at you, it's
as if you do not exist.

858
00:53:43,540 --> 00:53:47,940
Then Zabuza came along and looked at me,
and his eyes were not full of hate or fear.

859
00:53:48,240 --> 00:53:50,800
He did not shun me for my strangeness.

860
00:53:51,320 --> 00:53:54,060
Indeed, my special powers were just what
he wanted.

861
00:53:54,840 --> 00:53:57,000
He made me necessary again.

862
00:53:59,520 --> 00:54:01,000
Little kid like you.

863
00:54:01,640 --> 00:54:05,300
With no one to look after you,
you'll die a beggar's death.

864
00:54:09,530 --> 00:54:10,930
Hey, you know what?

865
00:54:11,250 --> 00:54:13,230
Your eyes remind me of mine.

866
00:54:19,530 --> 00:54:20,690
Well, little one.

867
00:54:20,890 --> 00:54:25,670
Will you stay here and die, or come with
me and be of some use?

868
00:54:25,910 --> 00:54:30,050
Will you serve me and submit to my will in
all things?

869
00:54:33,270 --> 00:54:42,870
Oh, I won't.

870
00:54:42,870 --> 00:54:42,870
For that, I'm runny and I can't team up
with the other boys.

871
00:54:42,871 --> 00:54:46,910
Then your special abilities belong to me
from this day forward.

872
00:54:47,870 --> 00:54:52,890
I want to know more about the Puppets.

873
00:54:54,830 --> 00:55:02,830
...I have a plan.

874
00:55:19,390 --> 00:55:20,750
A little pause... and we are back.

875
00:55:32,690 --> 00:55:33,210
Encouragement.

876
00:55:33,450 --> 00:55:37,350
I do not need these things, nor should you
expect them from me.

877
00:55:37,750 --> 00:55:38,750
I understand.

878
00:55:39,210 --> 00:55:40,650
I am yours, Zabuza.

879
00:55:40,830 --> 00:55:43,370
I am only an instrument of your will.

880
00:55:43,510 --> 00:55:47,850
Think of me as a weapon to be kept at your
side and used as you see fit.

881
00:55:50,540 --> 00:55:51,540
Well said, child.

882
00:55:53,450 --> 00:55:55,390
I have failed you, Zabuza.

883
00:55:56,190 --> 00:56:00,370
I am like a weapon that has been broken
and is of no further use.

884
00:56:09,890 --> 00:56:11,630
Naruto, kill me.

885
00:56:15,390 --> 00:56:16,740
Ninja art summoning!

886
00:56:17,059 --> 00:56:19,420
Earth-style fanged pursuit jutsu!

887
00:56:25,140 --> 00:56:27,180
I don't know why you bother.

888
00:56:27,400 --> 00:56:30,580
Of what use is your jutsu if you can't
even find me?

889
00:56:30,680 --> 00:56:32,500
But I can find you.

890
00:56:36,710 --> 00:56:38,650
Blindly falling into my trap.

891
00:56:38,950 --> 00:56:40,670
You disappoint me, Kakashi.

892
00:56:41,330 --> 00:56:42,750
I think you're right.

893
00:56:42,930 --> 00:56:45,510
It is time to put an end to this.

894
00:57:00,150 --> 00:57:05,010
I realized if I couldn't see you,
I'd have to smell you out.

895
00:57:05,130 --> 00:57:07,390
But that was a summoning jutsu.

896
00:57:07,470 --> 00:57:09,930
I was calling forth my ninja hounds.

897
00:57:09,931 --> 00:57:12,110
They can track a scent anywhere.

898
00:57:14,350 --> 00:57:18,130
When you attacked me, I let you get past
my guard.

899
00:57:18,370 --> 00:57:20,250
I wanted you to cut me.

900
00:57:20,410 --> 00:57:24,950
You see, it's the smell of my blood on
your blade that led them to you.

901
00:57:25,530 --> 00:57:26,090
Surprised?

902
00:57:26,210 --> 00:57:28,730
Looks like I wasn't the only one who was
blind.

903
00:57:30,270 --> 00:57:31,690
Falling into my trap.

904
00:57:31,950 --> 00:57:33,930
You disappoint me, Zabuza.

905
00:57:37,590 --> 00:57:39,630
The mist is finally clearing.

906
00:57:39,930 --> 00:57:41,490
And you know what I see?

907
00:57:42,250 --> 00:57:43,310
Your death.

908
00:57:43,970 --> 00:57:44,970
Talk, talk.

909
00:57:45,150 --> 00:57:46,870
Do you mean to talk me to death?

910
00:57:47,110 --> 00:57:48,430
In a way, yes.

911
00:57:48,870 --> 00:57:51,590
Right now my hounds are just playing with
you.

912
00:57:51,770 --> 00:57:54,790
But one word from me, and they'll tear you
apart.

913
00:57:56,890 --> 00:57:58,010
Poor Zabuza.

914
00:57:58,290 --> 00:58:00,290
See where your ambitions got you?

915
00:58:00,970 --> 00:58:03,610
You were always pushing things too far.

916
00:58:12,560 --> 00:58:16,880
Missing This is the failed Mizukage
assassination and your attempted coup d 'etat.

917
00:58:17,320 --> 00:58:20,224
You were forced to flee
with the few followers you

918
00:58:20,225 --> 00:58:23,320
had, your country's tracker
ninja hot on your heels.

919
00:58:23,580 --> 00:58:26,811
You became a rogue ninja
whose name was quickly

920
00:58:26,812 --> 00:58:29,540
known, even in the
village hidden in the leaves.

921
00:58:29,880 --> 00:58:33,400
Now you're crazy enough to want to go back
and try it again.

922
00:58:33,740 --> 00:58:37,134
But for that you need money,
and to get it you've stooped

923
00:58:37,135 --> 00:58:40,680
so low as to be the hired
thug of a swine like Gato.

924
00:58:43,120 --> 00:58:44,120
All right, Zabuza.

925
00:58:44,180 --> 00:58:45,180
Enough talk.

926
00:58:45,280 --> 00:58:46,640
Time to finish it.

927
00:58:46,760 --> 00:58:51,120
But it won't be with Sharingan,
imitations of some other ninja's tricks.

928
00:58:51,520 --> 00:58:51,960
No.

929
00:58:52,240 --> 00:58:56,460
It's time I introduced you to... my own
jutsu.

930
00:59:05,770 --> 00:59:07,210
Lightning Blade!

931
00:59:08,490 --> 00:59:11,430
His chakra is so strong it's visible!

932
00:59:11,910 --> 00:59:13,790
He holds it in his hands!

933
00:59:17,850 --> 00:59:19,930
Your future's all used up, Zabuza.

934
00:59:25,410 --> 00:59:26,410
Go on.

935
00:59:26,750 --> 00:59:27,750
Finish it.

936
00:59:27,910 --> 00:59:28,910
Kill me.

937
00:59:32,290 --> 00:59:33,950
Why do you hesitate?

938
00:59:38,330 --> 00:59:40,790
I thought you wanted to be a mighty
warrior.

939
00:59:41,150 --> 00:59:42,410
That's not what it's about!

940
00:59:42,970 --> 00:59:45,285
Do you really believe
that's all there is to it, just

941
00:59:45,286 --> 00:59:47,990
fighting and killing till there's
only one man left standing?

942
00:59:48,910 --> 00:59:51,230
There's a lot more to being shinobi than
that!

943
00:59:51,470 --> 00:59:53,007
And there are other
ways of showing your

944
00:59:53,008 --> 00:59:56,131
strength than just by
beating someone in battle!

945
00:59:56,810 --> 00:59:58,530
I've had a feeling all along.

946
00:59:59,090 --> 01:00:01,290
From the first moment we met in the woods.

947
01:00:01,950 --> 01:00:03,170
We're a lot alike.

948
01:00:06,070 --> 01:00:07,950
I'm sure you know what I mean.

949
01:00:09,390 --> 01:00:13,850
I'm only sorry that it must be your hand
that is tainted with my unworthy blood.

950
01:00:15,050 --> 01:00:16,150
Sure about this?

951
01:00:16,151 --> 01:00:19,630
And you're positive that it's the only
way?

952
01:00:21,890 --> 01:00:22,890
Yes.

953
01:00:26,270 --> 01:00:29,167
The weird thing is, if we
met in another time and

954
01:00:29,168 --> 01:00:31,730
place, I think that maybe
we could have been friends.

955
01:00:38,450 --> 01:00:39,450
Yes.

956
01:00:39,680 --> 01:00:40,680
That's right.

957
01:00:41,070 --> 01:00:42,790
Hold fast to your dreams.

958
01:00:43,290 --> 01:00:44,730
This is for Sasuke!

959
01:00:44,731 --> 01:00:47,110
Because he also had a dream!

960
01:00:56,370 --> 01:00:58,050
Thank you, Naruto.

961
01:00:58,730 --> 01:00:59,850
Strike true.

962
01:01:04,440 --> 01:01:07,600
At last, I think this blasted fog is
lifting.

963
01:01:09,390 --> 01:01:09,740
Hm?

964
01:01:10,370 --> 01:01:10,720
Look!

965
01:01:10,840 --> 01:01:11,840
They're standing still!

966
01:01:11,880 --> 01:01:13,140
Like they're squaring off!

967
01:01:13,540 --> 01:01:14,180
Yeah?

968
01:01:14,520 --> 01:01:16,180
I can't see a thing.

969
01:01:16,680 --> 01:01:18,420
Which one of them's Kakashi-sensei?

970
01:01:20,500 --> 01:01:21,500
One's moving!

971
01:01:25,580 --> 01:01:26,580
Huh?

972
01:01:27,180 --> 01:01:28,180
Huh?

973
01:01:36,600 --> 01:01:37,740
Sorry, Naruto.

974
01:01:38,020 --> 01:01:39,020
Change of plan.

975
01:01:44,440 --> 01:01:46,920
I'm not ready to die quite yet.

976
01:01:47,300 --> 01:01:48,300
Ah!

977
01:02:00,290 --> 01:02:02,010
Is this the end?

978
01:02:02,850 --> 01:02:03,850
Yes!

979
01:02:14,490 --> 01:02:15,490
And it was!

980
01:02:15,970 --> 01:02:16,970
Not yet.

981
01:02:17,130 --> 01:02:18,206
I'm starting to get excited.

982
01:02:18,230 --> 01:02:19,230
Oof!

983
01:02:53,320 --> 01:02:58,460
So, my future is all used up, huh?

984
01:03:01,140 --> 01:03:03,200
Wrong again, Kakashi.

985
01:03:05,260 --> 01:03:06,260
Uncle Gitchi!

986
01:03:07,095 --> 01:03:08,100
Uncle Gitchi, hurry!

987
01:03:08,340 --> 01:03:09,620
Come to the bridge with me!

988
01:03:11,220 --> 01:03:12,880
We don't have to hide any longer!

989
01:03:13,580 --> 01:03:16,160
If we all fight together, we can finally
take Kano down!

990
01:03:16,260 --> 01:03:17,260
I know we can!

991
01:03:18,000 --> 01:03:19,000
No, Inari.

992
01:03:19,750 --> 01:03:20,800
I've given up fighting.

993
01:03:21,900 --> 01:03:22,900
Fighting is for heroes.

994
01:03:23,700 --> 01:03:24,700
Like your father.

995
01:03:25,840 --> 01:03:27,000
You see what good it did him?

996
01:03:27,920 --> 01:03:29,920
Isn't one dead hero enough?

997
01:03:34,964 --> 01:03:38,470
What will more fighting bring us,
but more fallen heroes?

998
01:03:38,690 --> 01:03:39,690
And more regrets?

999
01:03:40,870 --> 01:03:41,870
No, Inari.

1000
01:03:42,810 --> 01:03:47,070
My heart is already full of enough
regrets... to last a lifetime.

1001
01:03:47,470 --> 01:03:49,630
All my life I've been a coward.

1002
01:03:50,450 --> 01:03:54,822
But now I know that crying and
hiding from things that we're afraid of...

1003
01:03:54,823 --> 01:03:56,291
doesn't make them go away!

1004
01:03:57,890 --> 01:03:59,451
... ...

1005
01:03:59,710 --> 01:04:00,710
...

1006
01:04:03,460 --> 01:04:04,460
...

1007
01:04:06,300 --> 01:04:06,820
Hurry!

1008
01:04:07,240 --> 01:04:08,260
Come to the bridge!

1009
01:04:08,660 --> 01:04:08,700
...

1010
01:04:09,580 --> 01:04:12,020
Our little Inari's become a man.

1011
01:04:12,600 --> 01:04:13,600
...

1012
01:04:14,600 --> 01:04:15,700
And you, dear?

1013
01:04:16,000 --> 01:04:18,960
Are you sure you want to send him off all
on his own?

1014
01:04:19,440 --> 01:04:20,961
... ...

1015
01:04:22,800 --> 01:04:23,800
...

1016
01:04:25,000 --> 01:04:26,280
Is anyone there?

1017
01:04:29,040 --> 01:04:31,841
Come to the bridge
with me and... ...

1018
01:04:39,440 --> 01:04:42,680
I have to go by myself because none of the
others will come with me!

1019
01:04:42,800 --> 01:04:43,800
...

1020
01:04:43,910 --> 01:04:44,920
I have no choice.

1021
01:04:45,800 --> 01:04:46,800
...

1022
01:04:55,710 --> 01:04:56,710
Stop this!

1023
01:04:56,765 --> 01:04:57,920
You're only a child!

1024
01:04:58,060 --> 01:04:59,400
What do you think you can do?

1025
01:05:00,160 --> 01:05:01,160
You're right.

1026
01:05:01,610 --> 01:05:02,610
I am just a kid.

1027
01:05:03,650 --> 01:05:06,180
But a kid who knows what it means to stand
and fight!

1028
01:05:07,200 --> 01:05:08,520
I'm my father's kid!

1029
01:05:09,640 --> 01:05:11,161
... ...

1030
01:05:12,060 --> 01:05:13,060
No!

1031
01:05:13,340 --> 01:05:14,340
Inari, wait!

1032
01:05:14,680 --> 01:05:15,680
Hm?

1033
01:05:16,000 --> 01:05:17,000
What?

1034
01:05:18,500 --> 01:05:19,500
Where'd he go?

1035
01:05:19,920 --> 01:05:20,500
... Huh?

1036
01:05:21,380 --> 01:05:22,380
Hey!

1037
01:05:23,580 --> 01:05:24,580
Ugh!

1038
01:05:25,695 --> 01:05:26,695
The fog's lifting!

1039
01:05:29,170 --> 01:05:30,940
Wait... is that him?

1040
01:05:32,220 --> 01:05:33,541
... ...

1041
01:05:35,700 --> 01:05:37,421
... ...

1042
01:05:38,740 --> 01:05:39,740
What?

1043
01:05:39,820 --> 01:05:41,040
I don't get it!

1044
01:05:41,060 --> 01:05:42,420
What the heck's going on here?

1045
01:05:43,180 --> 01:05:45,741
... ... ...

1046
01:05:47,080 --> 01:05:48,080
...

1047
01:05:48,640 --> 01:05:51,580
Isn't that... the young man in the mask?

1048
01:05:52,540 --> 01:05:57,120
He saved your worthless life... at the
cost of his own.

1049
01:05:58,820 --> 01:05:59,820
...

1050
01:06:00,820 --> 01:06:02,480
Well done, Haku.

1051
01:06:03,960 --> 01:06:05,241
... ...

1052
01:06:06,480 --> 01:06:08,121
... ...

1053
01:06:09,740 --> 01:06:11,060
Kakashi-sensei, watch out!

1054
01:06:11,380 --> 01:06:14,140
He'd hack right through the boy to take me
down?

1055
01:06:14,380 --> 01:06:18,280
... I knew I'd found a treasure
when I'd found you, boy!

1056
01:06:19,000 --> 01:06:22,660
You've not only given me my life,
but Kakashi's as well!

1057
01:06:25,080 --> 01:06:26,080
...

1058
01:06:28,540 --> 01:06:30,141
... ... ...

1059
01:06:34,680 --> 01:06:37,340
Not bad for having a corpse in your arms.

1060
01:06:37,760 --> 01:06:39,020
You'll pay for that!

1061
01:06:39,220 --> 01:06:39,460
No!

1062
01:06:39,720 --> 01:06:41,560
Stay out of this, Naruto!

1063
01:06:42,060 --> 01:06:43,060
...

1064
01:06:59,010 --> 01:06:59,890
Huh?

1065
01:06:59,891 --> 01:07:00,970
This is my battle.

1066
01:07:01,550 --> 01:07:02,870
Sabuza's mine.

1067
01:07:03,310 --> 01:07:05,250
... Naruto!

1068
01:07:05,930 --> 01:07:06,930
Over here!

1069
01:07:07,350 --> 01:07:08,350
Naruto!

1070
01:07:08,890 --> 01:07:09,890
...

1071
01:07:10,110 --> 01:07:13,110
Sakura... So you and
Sasuke are alright?

1072
01:07:13,550 --> 01:07:14,550
...

1073
01:07:15,724 --> 01:07:17,750
Um... What's wrong?

1074
01:07:18,780 --> 01:07:20,050
Where IS Sasuke, anyway?

1075
01:07:20,570 --> 01:07:21,570
...

1076
01:07:21,930 --> 01:07:26,570
... Ugh... ugh... no...

1077
01:07:29,410 --> 01:07:30,010
Kakashi!

1078
01:07:30,410 --> 01:07:32,610
I'd stay focused if I were you!

1079
01:07:37,445 --> 01:07:38,930
Let me take you to him, Sakura.

1080
01:07:39,670 --> 01:07:43,850
As long as we stay together, you won't be
disobeying your sensei's orders.

1081
01:07:45,030 --> 01:07:46,130
Thank you...

1082
01:07:56,710 --> 01:07:57,710
Sasuke...

1083
01:08:26,479 --> 01:08:27,720
His body's cold.

1084
01:08:28,180 --> 01:08:31,040
This isn't just one of his genjutsu
tricks, is it?

1085
01:08:33,700 --> 01:08:34,479
Go on.

1086
01:08:34,600 --> 01:08:36,800
You don't need to be brave on my account.

1087
01:08:37,600 --> 01:08:40,060
Go ahead and let your feelings out,
Sakura.

1088
01:08:40,220 --> 01:08:41,220
It's alright.

1089
01:08:49,560 --> 01:08:50,880
I was the best.

1090
01:08:51,420 --> 01:08:53,700
I aced every test at the academy.

1091
01:08:54,220 --> 01:08:55,540
The perfect student.

1092
01:08:59,970 --> 01:09:03,970
Did you know there are more than one
hundred principles of shinobi conduct?

1093
01:09:05,370 --> 01:09:07,229
I memorized every single one.

1094
01:09:07,790 --> 01:09:10,170
I used to love it when they tested us on
them.

1095
01:09:11,069 --> 01:09:13,350
Gave me a chance to show how smart I was.

1096
01:09:14,290 --> 01:09:16,830
I remember so clearly this one exam.

1097
01:09:17,910 --> 01:09:19,810
They asked us to explain the 25th
principle.

1098
01:09:20,410 --> 01:09:21,990
I got it right, of course.

1099
01:09:29,770 --> 01:09:32,750
A shinobi never shows his feelings.

1100
01:09:33,130 --> 01:09:35,490
No matter what the circumstance is.

1101
01:09:36,330 --> 01:09:41,370
Feelings are a weakness... that only cloud
his judgment and weaken his sense of duty.

1102
01:09:41,729 --> 01:09:44,910
Ugh... ugh... ugh...

1103
01:09:50,370 --> 01:09:54,229
To put such an unbearable burden on a
young girl's shoulders.

1104
01:09:54,730 --> 01:09:58,070
If that's the Shinobi way, you can have
it.

1105
01:10:27,100 --> 01:10:27,700
Why?

1106
01:10:28,060 --> 01:10:30,200
Why can't I keep up with him?

1107
01:10:51,250 --> 01:10:53,230
I'll split you in half!

1108
01:10:59,490 --> 01:11:00,490
Look at me!

1109
01:11:01,690 --> 01:11:02,070
Look at me!

1110
01:11:02,090 --> 01:11:02,170
Look at you.

1111
01:11:02,350 --> 01:11:03,530
You're falling apart.

1112
01:11:03,930 --> 01:11:06,710
I knew you didn't have what it takes for
the long haul.

1113
01:11:07,090 --> 01:11:08,110
What did you say?

1114
01:11:08,470 --> 01:11:12,330
You have no idea what real strength is.

1115
01:11:18,310 --> 01:11:19,470
Game over.

1116
01:11:19,820 --> 01:11:20,820
You lose.

1117
01:11:37,740 --> 01:11:39,710
Now both of your arms are useless.

1118
01:11:40,300 --> 01:11:41,300
What now?

1119
01:11:41,770 --> 01:11:43,470
You can't even make hand signs.

1120
01:11:44,970 --> 01:11:45,970
Hmm?

1121
01:11:49,590 --> 01:11:52,510
Did quite a job on you, didn't he,
Zabuza?

1122
01:11:52,750 --> 01:11:55,150
You look like yesterday's sashimi.

1123
01:11:56,190 --> 01:11:58,890
I must say, I'm disappointed.

1124
01:11:58,891 --> 01:11:59,891
Disappointed?

1125
01:12:04,130 --> 01:12:04,650
You're not.

1126
01:12:04,651 --> 01:12:04,930
Gato.

1127
01:12:05,490 --> 01:12:06,770
I don't understand.

1128
01:12:07,050 --> 01:12:08,110
What is all this?

1129
01:12:08,410 --> 01:12:09,730
Why are you here?

1130
01:12:09,950 --> 01:12:12,110
And who are these thugs you've brought
with you?

1131
01:12:12,810 --> 01:12:13,810
Hmm.

1132
01:12:14,250 --> 01:12:16,790
Well, you see, there's been a slight
change in plan.

1133
01:12:18,610 --> 01:12:22,950
According to the new plan, you die right
here on this bridge, Zabuza.

1134
01:12:24,710 --> 01:12:25,710
What?

1135
01:12:26,210 --> 01:12:26,950
That's right.

1136
01:12:27,110 --> 01:12:28,110
You're too expensive.

1137
01:12:28,350 --> 01:12:30,770
So I've decided to take you off the
payroll.

1138
01:12:31,010 --> 01:12:32,010
Of course.

1139
01:12:32,090 --> 01:12:36,110
Even these thugs I brought with me cost
something, so if you could manage to

1140
01:12:36,111 --> 01:12:39,910
slaughter a few of them before they take
you down, I'd appreciate it.

1141
01:12:40,310 --> 01:12:43,870
Think you can manage that, demon ninja of
the mist?

1142
01:12:45,470 --> 01:12:46,470
Look at you.

1143
01:12:46,570 --> 01:12:49,290
You look about as demonic as a wet kitten.

1144
01:12:50,910 --> 01:12:52,630
There are so many of them!

1145
01:12:52,810 --> 01:12:54,730
One rogue ninja was bad enough!

1146
01:12:56,405 --> 01:12:57,730
Well, well, Kakashi.

1147
01:12:58,360 --> 01:13:00,790
It would seem our fight is at an end.

1148
01:13:00,791 --> 01:13:05,450
Since I am no longer in Gato's employ,
Tazuna is safe.

1149
01:13:05,850 --> 01:13:07,110
We have no quarrel.

1150
01:13:07,930 --> 01:13:09,690
Yeah, I suppose you're right.

1151
01:13:16,390 --> 01:13:18,960
That reminds me... you little punk!

1152
01:13:19,140 --> 01:13:21,260
You grabbed me and nearly broke my arm!

1153
01:13:22,240 --> 01:13:24,860
I've been meaning to repay you for that!

1154
01:13:29,940 --> 01:13:32,680
I only wish he was alive to feel it.

1155
01:13:32,860 --> 01:13:33,860
Get away!

1156
01:13:35,040 --> 01:13:36,160
Get away from him, you scum!

1157
01:13:36,260 --> 01:13:36,380
Hey!

1158
01:13:36,381 --> 01:13:36,420
Stop!

1159
01:13:36,660 --> 01:13:37,700
Use your head!

1160
01:13:39,210 --> 01:13:40,760
Well, what about you, Zabuza?

1161
01:13:41,210 --> 01:13:42,520
You gonna let him do that?

1162
01:13:43,295 --> 01:13:44,540
Be quiet, you fool.

1163
01:13:45,160 --> 01:13:46,000
Haku's dead.

1164
01:13:46,160 --> 01:13:47,160
What does it matter?

1165
01:13:47,320 --> 01:13:47,520
What?

1166
01:13:48,030 --> 01:13:51,120
You mean you can just stand there and
watch him get treated like a dog?

1167
01:13:51,490 --> 01:13:52,980
You and Haku were together for years!

1168
01:13:53,040 --> 01:13:54,120
Doesn't that mean anything?

1169
01:13:54,880 --> 01:13:57,160
You don't understand the way of Shinobi.

1170
01:13:58,210 --> 01:14:01,100
I merely used him, just as Gato used me.

1171
01:14:01,101 --> 01:14:02,101
Huh?

1172
01:14:02,840 --> 01:14:03,980
Now it's over.

1173
01:14:05,420 --> 01:14:07,440
His usefulness is at an end.

1174
01:14:08,905 --> 01:14:11,200
The loss of his strength and skill,
yes.

1175
01:14:11,480 --> 01:14:13,240
That means something to me.

1176
01:14:14,240 --> 01:14:15,300
But the boy?

1177
01:14:16,260 --> 01:14:17,260
Nothing.

1178
01:14:18,970 --> 01:14:22,500
If you mean that, you're an even bigger
rat than I thought!

1179
01:14:22,750 --> 01:14:23,800
Okay, that's enough.

1180
01:14:24,650 --> 01:14:25,650
Calm down, Naruto.

1181
01:14:25,780 --> 01:14:26,780
He's not the enemy.

1182
01:14:27,070 --> 01:14:27,760
Not right now.

1183
01:14:28,040 --> 01:14:28,280
Ah!

1184
01:14:28,580 --> 01:14:29,580
Shut up!

1185
01:14:29,710 --> 01:14:31,080
Far as I'm concerned, he's enemy!

1186
01:14:31,081 --> 01:14:32,081
Enemy number one!

1187
01:14:34,010 --> 01:14:41,841
Why, you... you ungrateful... After
everything he did for you, Haku lived for you!

1188
01:14:41,935 --> 01:14:44,760
Is there... someone who's precious to you?

1189
01:14:45,780 --> 01:14:47,900
You were the most important thing in the
world to him!

1190
01:14:48,520 --> 01:14:51,069
For me, there is only
one person who matters,

1191
01:14:51,070 --> 01:14:53,460
and my purpose is to
protect and serve him.

1192
01:14:53,775 --> 01:14:56,040
And that purpose is what gives me my
strength.

1193
01:14:56,485 --> 01:14:57,840
And he meant nothing to you!

1194
01:14:58,110 --> 01:14:59,110
Nothing at all!

1195
01:15:01,130 --> 01:15:03,560
The way of Shinobi is very difficult for
me.

1196
01:15:05,360 --> 01:15:10,981
While he was sacrificing everything for
you, you never felt anything at all for him!

1197
01:15:11,600 --> 01:15:14,800
But I will do anything to see that his
dream is fulfilled.

1198
01:15:15,040 --> 01:15:17,220
Even become Shinobi if I must.

1199
01:15:18,360 --> 01:15:24,741
And if I become stronger, does that mean...
I'll become as cold-hearted as you are?

1200
01:15:24,980 --> 01:15:26,920
He threw his life away.

1201
01:15:27,860 --> 01:15:29,160
And for what?

1202
01:15:29,340 --> 01:15:30,520
For you and your dream?

1203
01:15:31,080 --> 01:15:33,420
I want only to make his dream come true.

1204
01:15:33,980 --> 01:15:35,580
That is my dream.

1205
01:15:37,280 --> 01:15:39,880
You never let him have a dream of his own.

1206
01:15:40,100 --> 01:15:41,360
But he didn't care.

1207
01:15:42,380 --> 01:15:43,540
I was happy.

1208
01:15:44,120 --> 01:15:47,500
And you just tossed him aside,
like he was nothing!

1209
01:15:48,820 --> 01:15:50,180
A broken tool!

1210
01:15:50,820 --> 01:15:52,340
Man, that's so wrong!

1211
01:15:52,840 --> 01:15:53,900
So wrong!

1212
01:15:56,700 --> 01:16:01,700
The End You talk too much.

1213
01:16:16,860 --> 01:16:18,960
Your words cut deep.

1214
01:16:19,860 --> 01:16:21,520
Deeper than any blade.

1215
01:16:26,690 --> 01:16:30,790
While he fought you... His
heart was breaking in two.

1216
01:16:31,190 --> 01:16:34,970
You see, Hakko was always too soft and too
kind.

1217
01:16:35,750 --> 01:16:41,010
He felt pain and sorrow, and now,
curse him, I feel them too.

1218
01:16:42,490 --> 01:16:47,270
And something else, I feel content that
this is the way it ends.

1219
01:16:54,090 --> 01:16:56,150
Well, Cat got your tongue.

1220
01:16:56,530 --> 01:16:59,450
Are you so surprised to discover that I'm
human?

1221
01:16:59,810 --> 01:17:01,530
Even Shinobi are human.

1222
01:17:01,730 --> 01:17:07,110
No matter how hard we try to escape that
simple fact, we always fail.

1223
01:17:08,929 --> 01:17:12,170
Well, at least, I have failed.

1224
01:17:16,410 --> 01:17:18,020
Boy, give me your kunai.

1225
01:17:18,835 --> 01:17:19,835
Ah...

1226
01:17:23,880 --> 01:17:24,880
Here.

1227
01:17:37,040 --> 01:17:38,260
That's enough of this!

1228
01:17:38,320 --> 01:17:38,820
Do it!

1229
01:17:38,940 --> 01:17:39,980
Take him down now!

1230
01:17:42,020 --> 01:17:44,100
He must be out of his mind!

1231
01:17:44,420 --> 01:17:45,720
One against all of us?

1232
01:17:45,740 --> 01:17:46,740
What's he thinking?

1233
01:17:50,360 --> 01:17:51,480
Come on!

1234
01:17:53,700 --> 01:17:54,760
Let me do something!

1235
01:17:56,440 --> 01:17:57,440
Hurry up!

1236
01:18:04,420 --> 01:18:05,420
Yeah!

1237
01:18:09,600 --> 01:18:10,640
There you are!

1238
01:18:10,800 --> 01:18:11,800
Get him!

1239
01:18:12,120 --> 01:18:13,120
Ah!

1240
01:18:17,680 --> 01:18:18,920
He's the devil!

1241
01:18:19,760 --> 01:18:20,760
Ah!

1242
01:18:21,280 --> 01:18:22,280
Ah!

1243
01:18:22,480 --> 01:18:22,860
Ah!

1244
01:18:23,260 --> 01:18:24,260
Ah!

1245
01:18:24,740 --> 01:18:25,740
Ah!

1246
01:18:26,160 --> 01:18:27,160
Ah!

1247
01:18:38,000 --> 01:18:39,820
You crazy fool!

1248
01:18:40,140 --> 01:18:42,900
If you're so eager to join your friend,
go ahead.

1249
01:18:43,955 --> 01:18:45,200
But you're not taking me!

1250
01:18:45,600 --> 01:18:47,420
Not this time!!!

1251
01:18:49,400 --> 01:18:51,780
I won't be joining Hakko.

1252
01:18:52,650 --> 01:18:54,540
Where he's gone I cannot follow.

1253
01:18:54,760 --> 01:18:56,281
Huh... Err...

1254
01:18:57,440 --> 01:18:58,220
Stay back!

1255
01:18:58,420 --> 01:18:59,420
Stay back!

1256
01:18:59,780 --> 01:19:02,680
We wouldn't be welcome where Haku's gone
to.

1257
01:19:03,120 --> 01:19:04,940
Hell's where we're going, Gato!

1258
01:19:06,515 --> 01:19:11,700
I can't think of a more fitting
destination for a demon ninja, can you?

1259
01:19:11,785 --> 01:19:15,800
I'm told there are many demons down there,
of all shapes and sizes.

1260
01:19:16,240 --> 01:19:18,420
Oh yes, I should fit right in.

1261
01:19:18,760 --> 01:19:21,080
You, on the other hand, Gato...

1262
01:19:21,081 --> 01:19:24,640
Well, I fear you're in for a long and very
painful eternity!

1263
01:20:08,450 --> 01:20:09,450
...

1264
01:20:18,840 --> 01:20:19,840
Haku...

1265
01:20:25,630 --> 01:20:29,450
So this is... goodbye... at last.

1266
01:20:31,410 --> 01:20:33,950
Not once did I ever thank you,
Haku.

1267
01:20:35,050 --> 01:20:36,690
Forgive me for that.

1268
01:20:48,900 --> 01:20:49,620
Don't turn away.

1269
01:20:49,621 --> 01:20:54,880
When you live like a warrior, this is how
it ends.

1270
01:21:01,250 --> 01:21:02,540
Where am I?

1271
01:21:03,100 --> 01:21:04,200
Am I alive?

1272
01:21:04,740 --> 01:21:06,760
Or... Sakura?

1273
01:21:07,940 --> 01:21:08,940
Can it be?

1274
01:21:10,990 --> 01:21:14,000
It is... Sakura.

1275
01:21:15,235 --> 01:21:17,720
It's hard to breathe with you on top of
me.

1276
01:21:19,160 --> 01:21:20,160
Sasuke!

1277
01:21:28,360 --> 01:21:29,110
Tatsuna!

1278
01:21:29,111 --> 01:21:30,150
He's alive!

1279
01:21:30,550 --> 01:21:31,550
Alive!

1280
01:21:32,030 --> 01:21:33,450
Sakura, that hurts!

1281
01:21:33,830 --> 01:21:34,050
Sasuke!

1282
01:21:34,310 --> 01:21:35,310
Sasuke!

1283
01:21:35,430 --> 01:21:37,950
So things turned out right after all.

1284
01:21:38,950 --> 01:21:39,650
No!

1285
01:21:39,970 --> 01:21:41,310
No, what are you doing?

1286
01:21:41,450 --> 01:21:42,490
You shouldn't move!

1287
01:21:42,750 --> 01:21:43,750
How's Naruto?

1288
01:21:44,630 --> 01:21:47,310
And what happened to that guy in the mask?

1289
01:21:48,030 --> 01:21:49,290
Naruto's just fine.

1290
01:21:49,291 --> 01:21:53,810
But the... the one in the mask... he's
dead.

1291
01:21:54,370 --> 01:21:54,930
Dead?

1292
01:21:55,130 --> 01:21:56,130
But how?

1293
01:21:56,210 --> 01:21:57,770
Did Naruto do it?

1294
01:21:57,930 --> 01:22:00,210
Oh, I... I came in late.

1295
01:22:00,230 --> 01:22:01,310
I'm not sure what happened.

1296
01:22:01,410 --> 01:22:03,170
He was protecting Zabuza.

1297
01:22:06,390 --> 01:22:08,390
I had faith in you, Sasuke.

1298
01:22:08,670 --> 01:22:10,150
I knew you'd pull through.

1299
01:22:10,390 --> 01:22:12,650
You're too cool a guy to stay down for
long.

1300
01:22:13,950 --> 01:22:17,090
He never meant to... from the very
beginning.

1301
01:22:17,710 --> 01:22:18,710
Naruto!

1302
01:22:19,290 --> 01:22:20,290
Over here!

1303
01:22:20,390 --> 01:22:20,970
Look!

1304
01:22:21,110 --> 01:22:21,750
It's Sasuke!

1305
01:22:22,070 --> 01:22:22,570
He's alright!

1306
01:22:22,930 --> 01:22:23,930
He's alright!

1307
01:22:35,850 --> 01:22:37,010
But how?

1308
01:22:37,390 --> 01:22:40,910
While he fought you, his heart was
breaking in two.

1309
01:22:41,350 --> 01:22:45,090
You see, Haku was always too soft and too
kind.

1310
01:22:46,550 --> 01:22:47,590
I see.

1311
01:22:49,290 --> 01:22:49,870
Well, well.

1312
01:22:50,050 --> 01:22:51,530
Well, wonders never cease.

1313
01:22:52,530 --> 01:22:53,530
Amazing.

1314
01:22:55,835 --> 01:22:56,570
Hey!

1315
01:22:56,571 --> 01:22:57,571
Yoo-hoo!

1316
01:22:58,050 --> 01:22:59,890
Don't go getting too comfortable!

1317
01:23:00,190 --> 01:23:01,730
This party ain't over yet!

1318
01:23:02,010 --> 01:23:04,430
Who's gonna pay us now that Gato's gone?

1319
01:23:04,730 --> 01:23:07,070
No way we're gonna leave here
empty-handed!

1320
01:23:07,350 --> 01:23:10,810
So we'll just have to hit that village and
see what they've got for us!

1321
01:23:10,990 --> 01:23:11,310
Yeah!

1322
01:23:11,311 --> 01:23:12,070
Come on!

1323
01:23:12,071 --> 01:23:13,071
Not good.

1324
01:23:13,270 --> 01:23:14,770
Come on, Kakashi-sensei!

1325
01:23:14,771 --> 01:23:17,370
You must have a jutsu that can take care
of this bunch of losers!

1326
01:23:17,371 --> 01:23:18,690
Not right now.

1327
01:23:18,750 --> 01:23:20,190
I use too much of my chakra.

1328
01:23:20,710 --> 01:23:21,910
Get him, boys!

1329
01:23:31,650 --> 01:23:34,350
There's one little thing you're forgetting
about.

1330
01:23:34,750 --> 01:23:39,550
Before you set one foot in our village,
you'll have to go through all of us!

1331
01:23:41,070 --> 01:23:42,070
Inari!

1332
01:23:43,290 --> 01:23:46,510
Heroes usually show up at the last minute,
you know.

1333
01:23:47,730 --> 01:23:48,930
They've all come.

1334
01:23:49,170 --> 01:23:50,570
The whole village.

1335
01:23:56,490 --> 01:23:59,310
No way I'm gonna miss out on all the fun!

1336
01:23:59,690 --> 01:24:01,430
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

1337
01:24:06,350 --> 01:24:10,210
I might have just enough chakra left to
help you out.

1338
01:24:11,110 --> 01:24:13,270
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

1339
01:24:14,770 --> 01:24:16,150
Kakashi-style!

1340
01:24:18,810 --> 01:24:19,810
Okay.

1341
01:24:19,890 --> 01:24:21,310
Still want to fight?

1342
01:24:21,610 --> 01:24:22,610
No thanks!

1343
01:24:28,210 --> 01:24:29,210
Victory!

1344
01:24:52,400 --> 01:24:54,500
Sounds like it's over.

1345
01:24:55,120 --> 01:24:56,120
Yeah.

1346
01:24:58,420 --> 01:25:01,660
Kakashi, I have a favor to ask.

1347
01:25:02,360 --> 01:25:03,360
What is it?

1348
01:25:05,450 --> 01:25:06,480
Take me to him.

1349
01:25:07,770 --> 01:25:10,660
Before I go, I need to see him one last
time.

1350
01:25:14,640 --> 01:25:15,640
Sure.

1351
01:25:40,385 --> 01:25:41,385
Huh?

1352
01:25:43,240 --> 01:25:44,240
Impossible.

1353
01:25:44,870 --> 01:25:46,460
Snowing at this time of year?

1354
01:25:55,070 --> 01:25:56,990
Is it you, Haku?

1355
01:25:57,410 --> 01:25:58,910
Are you weeping?

1356
01:26:10,940 --> 01:26:11,940
Kakashi...

1357
01:26:15,040 --> 01:26:16,040
You

1358
01:26:20,430 --> 01:26:22,110
were always at my side.

1359
01:26:22,930 --> 01:26:28,130
The least I can do... is to
be beside you at the end.

1360
01:26:28,890 --> 01:26:33,310
How long are you going to make me stay at
the end of these counties?

1361
01:26:40,070 --> 01:26:47,550
I know it cannot be, but I wish I could go
to where you have gone.

1362
01:26:48,370 --> 01:26:51,390
Oh, I wish I could join you there.

1363
01:26:54,550 --> 01:26:55,550
Aku...

1364
01:27:16,550 --> 01:27:21,190
He told me where he came from,
it was always snowing.

1365
01:27:21,850 --> 01:27:23,110
All the time.

1366
01:27:24,990 --> 01:27:26,270
Of course.

1367
01:27:27,510 --> 01:27:30,270
His spirit was as pure as the snow.

1368
01:27:32,500 --> 01:27:34,291
You never know... Oh, Zabuza.

1369
01:27:34,660 --> 01:27:36,370
Maybe you will join him there.

1370
01:27:38,500 --> 01:27:39,500
Who's to say?

1371
01:27:43,520 --> 01:27:46,060
Is that really it, Kakashi-sensei?

1372
01:27:46,530 --> 01:27:49,500
Is that the ninja way?

1373
01:27:50,565 --> 01:27:52,680
To use and be used by people like tools?

1374
01:27:55,250 --> 01:27:58,380
Shinobi are all merely tools in the hands
of destiny.

1375
01:27:59,510 --> 01:28:01,760
No point in wondering whether it's right
or wrong.

1376
01:28:02,355 --> 01:28:03,355
It just is.

1377
01:28:03,850 --> 01:28:05,600
It's the same in the village itself.

1378
01:28:42,250 --> 01:28:42,850
Okay!

1379
01:28:43,270 --> 01:28:44,270
Hm?

1380
01:28:44,955 --> 01:28:46,170
I've just come to a decision.

1381
01:28:46,470 --> 01:28:49,370
From now on I'm finding my own Ninja Way.

1382
01:28:49,830 --> 01:28:52,990
A way that's straight and true and without
any regrets.

1383
01:28:53,430 --> 01:28:56,010
From now on I'm following the way of
Naruto!

1384
01:29:07,230 --> 01:29:10,490
We could never have finished the bridge
without you.

1385
01:29:12,590 --> 01:29:15,290
I can't tell you how much we're going to
miss you.

1386
01:29:15,450 --> 01:29:16,450
Do be careful.

1387
01:29:17,010 --> 01:29:18,350
Thank you for everything.

1388
01:29:18,970 --> 01:29:19,970
Now, now.

1389
01:29:20,110 --> 01:29:21,390
Don't get all choked up.

1390
01:29:21,590 --> 01:29:23,350
We'll come back and visit real soon.

1391
01:29:24,740 --> 01:29:26,170
You swear you will?

1392
01:29:31,490 --> 01:29:32,550
Of course.

1393
01:29:32,920 --> 01:29:35,970
You know, Inari, it's alright to cry if
you want.

1394
01:29:36,205 --> 01:29:37,485
There's nothing wrong with that.

1395
01:29:37,675 --> 01:29:38,675
Go for it.

1396
01:29:38,900 --> 01:29:40,070
Who says I want to cry?

1397
01:29:40,530 --> 01:29:43,490
Anyway, if there's nothing wrong with it,
then why don't you go on and cry?

1398
01:29:44,310 --> 01:29:44,790
No!

1399
01:29:44,791 --> 01:29:45,791
You first!

1400
01:29:52,690 --> 01:29:53,690
Forget it!

1401
01:29:57,290 --> 01:29:59,470
Boys can be so pathetic.

1402
01:30:03,470 --> 01:30:05,150
It was all his doing.

1403
01:30:05,390 --> 01:30:07,630
That boy made you stronger, Inari.

1404
01:30:07,770 --> 01:30:10,230
And you were... You, in turn,
made the rest of us stronger.

1405
01:30:11,070 --> 01:30:12,910
It was thanks to that boy.

1406
01:30:13,210 --> 01:30:16,250
We were able to build a bridge to a place
we'd never known.

1407
01:30:16,490 --> 01:30:18,510
A place where we found our courage.

1408
01:30:18,810 --> 01:30:21,150
A place to fulfill our dreams.

1409
01:30:21,790 --> 01:30:26,470
Say, speaking of the bridge, now that it's
finished, shouldn't we name it?

1410
01:30:26,870 --> 01:30:28,090
Yes, of course.

1411
01:30:28,730 --> 01:30:31,430
And I know just the name.

1412
01:30:31,830 --> 01:30:32,830
You do?

1413
01:30:33,050 --> 01:30:33,610
What?

1414
01:30:33,870 --> 01:30:36,990
We'll call it... The Great Naruto Bridge.

1415
01:30:38,770 --> 01:30:40,030
That's a very good name.

1416
01:30:40,370 --> 01:30:40,830
Haha!

1417
01:30:41,170 --> 01:30:44,414
As soon as we get back, I'm
gonna let Iruka-sensei fix me up

1418
01:30:44,415 --> 01:30:46,990
a whole mess of ramen to
celebrate a mission accomplished!

1419
01:30:47,350 --> 01:30:47,630
Oh!

1420
01:30:47,850 --> 01:30:50,730
And just wait till I tell Konohamaru about
all my adventures!

1421
01:30:51,010 --> 01:30:52,630
The kid's gonna worship me!

1422
01:30:52,870 --> 01:30:53,250
Hey!

1423
01:30:53,630 --> 01:30:54,090
Yeah?

1424
01:30:54,310 --> 01:30:55,310
Not you, Naruto.

1425
01:30:55,830 --> 01:30:58,650
Sasuke, when we get back, you wanna go out
and do something together?

1426
01:30:58,930 --> 01:30:59,750
I don't think so.

1427
01:30:59,930 --> 01:31:00,310
Thanks.

1428
01:31:00,610 --> 01:31:00,950
Oh.

1429
01:31:01,490 --> 01:31:02,490
Okay.

1430
01:31:02,990 --> 01:31:05,230
Sakura, I'd do something with you if you
want.

1431
01:31:05,810 --> 01:31:06,270
What?!

1432
01:31:06,271 --> 01:31:08,090
Hey, that was a private conversation!

1433
01:31:12,640 --> 01:31:14,570
It was something that Haku said to me.

1434
01:31:14,870 --> 01:31:18,190
He told me that when people are protecting
something that is truly precious to them,

1435
01:31:18,230 --> 01:31:20,390
that's when they can become genuinely
stronger.

1436
01:31:23,490 --> 01:31:24,490
I see.

1437
01:31:25,170 --> 01:31:26,810
And you agree with him, do you?

1438
01:31:27,550 --> 01:31:28,550
You bet.

1439
01:31:28,910 --> 01:31:32,410
After watching Haku with Sabuza,
I know he's right.

1440
01:31:32,850 --> 01:31:35,430
Hey, um, wait a second, Kakashi-sensei.

1441
01:31:35,431 --> 01:31:36,470
Tell me something.

1442
01:31:36,610 --> 01:31:37,610
What do you think?

1443
01:31:39,070 --> 01:31:41,090
You sure about that name, Tazuna?

1444
01:31:42,790 --> 01:31:44,670
It's a name that brought us good luck.

1445
01:31:44,910 --> 01:31:46,630
It'll do the same for the bridge.

1446
01:31:47,030 --> 01:31:50,970
I think this bridge will stand for a long,
long time.

1447
01:31:51,950 --> 01:31:54,390
Perhaps it will even be famous one day.

1448
01:31:54,490 --> 01:31:57,390
The name Naruto, known throughout the
world.

1449
01:31:59,690 --> 01:32:02,090
That would be something, wouldn't it?

1450
01:32:20,660 --> 01:32:21,800
Yeah.

1451
01:32:28,100 --> 01:32:34,480
Um, yeah, there's that name...

1452
01:32:37,500 --> 01:32:41,940
That God Two in Haku's Marriage
Umm... Never falling down.

1453
01:32:44,620 --> 01:32:48,500
My knee is too shaken, like I was twelve.

1454
01:32:48,740 --> 01:32:51,920
Sneaking out the classroom, by the back
door.

1455
01:32:52,080 --> 01:32:53,820
I'm alright, let me try some.

1456
01:32:54,120 --> 01:32:55,320
But I didn't care.

1457
01:32:55,660 --> 01:32:58,700
Waiting is wasting, for people like me.

1458
01:32:59,180 --> 01:33:01,720
Don't try, it's alright.

1459
01:33:02,240 --> 01:33:05,100
Don't cry, cause you're alright.

1460
01:33:05,820 --> 01:33:08,840
Don't try, this makes no sense.

1461
01:33:08,841 --> 01:33:12,320
Cause you will hate yourself in the end.

1462
01:33:21,820 --> 01:33:25,060
Don't try, to look so wise.

1463
01:33:25,420 --> 01:33:28,340
Don't cry, cause you're so alright.

1464
01:33:28,680 --> 01:33:31,780
Don't try, which fakes all fears.

1465
01:33:32,220 --> 01:33:35,300
Cause you will hate yourself in the end.

1466
01:33:35,560 --> 01:33:38,720
Don't cry, it looks so wise.

1467
